<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">Yanisa Mishiracho</para>
  <para style="mt">Yanisa Mishiracho</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qaalay kasse koyro dees. Qallakka Xoossa achan dees. He qalaaykka Xoossa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izee koyro Xoossa achchan dees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Medheteththi wurii izann medhetdes. Medhettdazan izi baynda medhetiday isiinaka dukku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Deyooy ezann deyssu. hana deyooya asas poo7. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Poo77y dhumaan poo7ses. dhumayy poo7 muleeka xonena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossafe kiitetda Yanissa getettiza isadeey dess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iza markkatithaan asi wurii amanna malla Po77s markka giddii yidess. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Izi poo7o gish markatana yides atiin izi ba hues po7o gidena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asa wursoos po7o imiiza tumu poo7oy hayssa ha alamezan yusan dess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qaalayka kase alamen dess. almeykka medhetdday izana. Gido atin alameey iza erribeeyna. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izi ba bagtako yiin iza bagaty iza ekiibetena. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gido attin iza ekdaytii iza sunesaa amaniddayta isti xossa naytia gidana maata isstass iimdess. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isttikka xossa nayta gididay xoossafe yelettida gish attin asa zeerethafe heskka asa wogan woykko asho shenen gidena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qaallayka ass giddies, Xossa kiyatethinne tumann kumidii nunaan aqqides, Isi nass awa matan diza bonchoo milatza iza booncho nu beydos. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yanssaykka “tappe guyera yizaysi tafe adhees, gasooyka izi tape kaseka dess gada ta intees yotidaysi hekoo haysi izako” gii matatidess. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iza kumetha kiyatethan nu wuri keyatetha bolla kiyateth ekkidos. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wogay musse baggara immetidas, kiyatethine tumay gidiikoo Yesuss Kirsitosa baggara nusii yidess. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xooss beyedaye oonnkka bawa, gido attin Xossa aawa matan diza xoossa na xoossay issay xalala iza qonccissidess.</para>
  <para style="s">Xamaqqza Yanssa marikateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ayhudata dannatii Yerusalamappe qeessistane Lewe nayetta Yanssakoo kitidii “ne oonee?” gidi oychchishin, <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yanssay “tani Kiristtosa gidikee” gidi geshshi markkatides attin markkatanas ixxibeyna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Isttika “histtine ne oonne? ne Elassa? gidi oychchida, izki gidike” gidi isttas zaaridess, Isttika “izi yana kittetida nabey nene?” gida. izika “akaye tana gidke” gidas. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Istii qaas “histin ne onee? nuna kitda asas nu yotanamalla ne nena ona gay?” gida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izika “nabe Isayasay yootidaysa mala tani xoossa ogge suriistte gishe bazoo biitann wasiizade qalla girethth” gidess. <verse number="24" style="v"/>parssawistappe kittettda issi issi asati <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hesa gish “ne Xoossi kittidade woykko buroo yana getetida nabaye nene gidontta gidikoo hstiin azaas nuna xmaqqazi?” gidii iza oychchida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yanssaykka istasi hzgidass “ta haththn xamaqqays gido atiin inte eroontadey inte giddon eqqides. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tappe guyera yanaysi iza, ta iza ccama qachcho birshanass besizade gidikke. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Haysi wuri haniday Yanssay xamiqqiza Yordanosse shshafappe he pinththan diza Biitaniyaa getetiza katamana. Biitaniyay</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa doorssa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Wonteththa glass Yanissay Yasussay beeko yishshin beydi &lt;deree nagara biitappe digana Xoossa doorssay hekko hysichchi! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tapee guyerra yanayysi izi tappe kassekka diza gish tappe adhdhess&gt; gada ta intess yotizzay haysichch! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Takaa ta bagaraa iza eraabeyke shin gidikooka izi Isra7ele deress qonchnamala ta haththan xxamaqashshe yadiss.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kaleththidika Yanissayy hizgi markatidess. “Xiiloo Ayanay woole kafoo milattdii salopee woodhishshinne iza bolla uttshin beyadiss. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ta tabagara iza eriike shin ta haththan xmaqqanamalla tana kiitidadey &lt;Xiilloo Ayanay iza bola wodhidi shempishshin nee beyanadey Xiiloo Ayanan meccnay izakko&gt; gidii tas yoottidess. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taka hessa beyadiss. Hessa gish izi Xoossa na gididaysa ta markatays.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussa kalida koyroytta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wontetha galass Yanissay bena kaliza nam7atara heen eqqides. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesussay iza achchara adhdhishshn Yanissay beydii “Xoossa dorssay hekkoo haysichch!” gides. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yanssa kalliza nam7ati hessa siiydii Yesussa kallida. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Istii iza kaliishshn yesussa guye yuuy xellidii “ayy kooyetii?” gidees. Istkka “asstamaare ne dussasoy awaa?” gida. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Izikka ista “ha ydii beyte” gidess. Hessa gish bidii izii awan dizakko be7idane he gllass izara isppe pe7ida. Wodeykka gedee tamuu sateso bidess. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yanissay yotida qaala siydii Yesussa kallida nam7atappe issay Simoona Phixiroossa ishsha Indirassa. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Indirassay koyroo ba ishsha simoonakko bidinne “Xoossi kitida kirstossa nu demidos!.” gidess. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Indirassay Simoona Yesussakko ekii yides. Yesussaykka iza tishsh hisiti xelidii. “hayso ne Yoonna na Simoonakko, hayssafe guye ne Keehaaththaa geetistana.” Kehaaththaa gusi Phixrossa gusa wyykoo zlaa shuchu gusa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Pilphoossane Natin7ele xegidess.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wonteththa gallas Yesusay Galilla banass koydees. Piliphoosska demiidi “tana kalla” gidess. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pilphoossaykka Indirasamalane Phixiroossamala Batesaydda kattama asa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Piphoossay natina7ele demiidi “Mussey woga maxxafan qase nabetiikka burope hanana yotiza bee maxxafatann iza gish xafida adeza nuu demidos, izikka Yosefo na Nazirete Yesussakko” gides. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Natina7eley qass “Nazireteppe lo7o miishi beti erizee?” gi oychin Pilphossay iza “ha yada beya” gides. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Natina7eley Yesussa beyana yishin yesussay beydi iza “hekko geney bayndda tumu Isra77ele ass!” giidi iza gish yotidess. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Natina77eleykka zaridi “tana woosta eradii?” gi oychin Yesussaykka “Pilipoossay nena xeyiganappe kase Balasse miththa garsan ne dishshin ta nena beyaddis” gi zarin. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Natina77eleay “asstammarea! ne Xoossa na ne Israe77ele kawo” gides. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesussaykka izas “ne amaniiday ta neena baallass miththa garsan beyadis” gidagsshe? ne buro hessafe adhdhiza daro miish beyana. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Gujidikka ta intes tumu gays buro sallooy dooyetin Xoossa kiitanchati asa na bolla wdhishininne kezishin inte beyana.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay hathe woyne ushan lamidess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hedzdzantho galas Galillan garsan diza Qaana gettetizza Kataman sargey dees. Yesussa Ayeeyakka hen dawus. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesussayne iza kalizaytikka sargezaso xxeygetida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sargezason woynefe agida ushshayi wuriini Yesussa ayaa Yesussa “woyiine ushshayi wurdeskko” gaduss. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesussaykka izo “Ayye tass nenara azi dizze, ta woddeye gakiibeynakko gides” <verse number="5" style="v"/>He wode Yesussa ayeya Marama hen gadeezzan diza oothanchata “izi initena gizaaysa oththite” gadus. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ayhudatas geshshoo wogayi diza gish usupuuni shuchchafe medhdhetiida gaanetti heen iza ollan dettes, isittikka issay issay nam77u otto wayeko hedzdzuu otto hathth oyikkes. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesussay oththanichchata “ganeetta heththe kuniithitte” gin isstikka ganetta duunna gakanas cip hisitti kunnththida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hassafe qassekka oththanichchate “anne ha7i duqqidi sargeza allafezas izappe duqqii imiite” gidesi. Istika duuqqi imiida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Alaafeziikka wooynne ushchan lamettada haththa ganxxi xallidiine izi awappe yidakkonne eribeyna. Haththa duqqidayti gidikko erettes. Hessa gish sargeza allahaaththaey mishiraza xegiidi hizgiidesi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Assi wuri sargeesoon koyyro lo7o usshshi shishshees, asay maththotidappe guye iitta ehes shini ne qass lo7o ushshu hano gakanas woththagadasa.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa mallalisiza malata wursofe koyro Galila getetiza deren Qana katamane othides. Be bonchoka hessamalan xoncisides. Iza kalizaytka izan amanida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesussay ba Ayera ba ishatarane bena kalizaytara duge Qifirnahome wodhidi hen gutha wode deyida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay maqidasen zaliizayta godidase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ayhudata paziga ba7aaleye matida gish Yesussay Yarussalame bidess. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Maqqidase gibbe gidon borata doresatanne wolista bayzizayta qassekka mishe lamizayti mishe lamishin demidess. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hesa beydi wodoro durqafe doqqi ekidi asanne boratakka maqidqse gibefe kesidese, mishsh lamizyta mishaka dharcidi ista xraphezatakka shiri yagidass. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Woole bayziza asakka “hayssa wursi gede digitte ta Awa ketha zale7a keeth histofitte” gidess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>He wode iza kalizayti “ne ketha michay tana tamamala xugess” geteti xafetida qaalla hasa7ida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Ayhude asa halaqati Yesussa “Ne haysssa wurssa oothanas sheney ness dizaysa qoncisanas ne nuna ay malalthiza malata besanee?” gi oychida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesussaykka istas “anne hayssa maqidaseza lalite ta iza heedzdzu galasara zara kexxana” gi zaridess. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Istika iza “hayssa maqidaseza kexxanas kasa ooydu tammane usupun layth ekidess histin neni hezu glasara kexxa kunthanee?” gi oychida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Gido atin Yesussay “maqqidase” giday ba asatetha gishasa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesussay hayqi dendin iza kalizayti he yozza yushi qopidi eridanne hayssa kasse maxafan xafetidaysanne Yesussay istas kaseti yotida qaalla amanida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Fazigaa ba7ale galas Yesussay Yerusalamen diishe oothida malatataa beydi daro asay iza amanidess. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qasse Yesussay asa wursi eriza gish onakka amanibeyna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izi aussa wozzinan diza wursi eriza gish onikka izas asa gish yotanas koshibeyna.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussanne Niqodimossa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Parsawista baga ass gidida ayhudata hllaqappe issi Niqodimossa getetizaday assi dess. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izi qamara Yesussakko yidi “astamare Xoossi izara dzade gidikofe atin hayta ne oothiza malalsiza malatata oothanas danda7izadeye dena. Hessa gish ne Xoossa achafe yida astamare gdidayysa nuu erosu” gidass. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesussaykka izas zaridi “ta nes tumu gays assi namantho yeletoonta agikko Xoossa kawoteth beynanas danda7ena” gidess. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niqodimosaykka zaridi “histin assi cimidappe guye wandi namaantho yeletan danda7izee? Qassekka gede bee aye ul7on simi gelidi yeletanee?” gidi oychides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesussyka izas hizggidi zarides “ta nes tumu gays assi hathafenne Xillo Anappe yeletontaa dishe Xoossa kawoteth gelanass danda7ena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Asappe yelettida asa. Ayanappe yeletdeye ayana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish &lt;inte nmma7antho yeletanas kooshes&gt; ta nena gida gish malaletofa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Carkkoy ba koyida baga carkess, ne carkoss gireth siyasa atin izi awappe yizakkonne awa bizakko erakka, ayanafe yelettidaykka hessa malla.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Niqodimossay “haysi wani hnana danda7ize?” gidi oychdess. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesussaykka izas “Isra7ele Astemare gidautada hessa ne eriki? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta nes tumu gays nuni nu erazaysa yotoss, nu be7idaysa markatos gido attin inte nu markateth ekekketta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta intess hayssa ha biitta yo yotin amanonta ixikko sallo miish yotikko wosti inte wosti ammanane? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Saloppe dugge wopdhia asa naape attin pude saloo keziday haray onikka denna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bazoo biittan Musey shoshu dhoqqu histi kaqqidaysatho heesathokka asa nayy dhoqqan kaqistanas beses. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessikka izan ammanizadeye wurikka medhina deyo demanasa gsaasa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossa na ammanizay wuri medhina deyo demanappe attin dhayonta mala Xoossi hayssa alameza daro siqida gish ba mixi issi na immides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoassay ba naza ha dugge alame kittday alame asay izan amanidi atinn izi alamme asa bolla firdanas gidena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iza amanizade bola pirdetena, iza amanonntadey gdikko Xoossa na isinezan amanonta gish benipekka pirdeti utides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pirdayyka hysamala po77oy ha alame yides shin asas oothoy iitta gdidagish asay po7oppe daro dumma doosides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iita o7htzadeye wurikka poo7 dosena. izi o7thazza ita o7thooy pooncci kkazontamala izi ba huees poo77y dzzasa kezena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tuumu o7thzadey gdiiko po77y dizasa yees. izi po77y dizzasa yeza gasoy Xoossa azazzomalla izi o7thdda o7thooy qonncana maalla.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussanee xxamaqqza Yaansa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe kallidi Yesussy bena kallizaytara Yhuudaa dere bedess. heniikka Asaa xxamaqqshe istarra guusa woode gmmidess. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hee wode salleme achaan Henoone gistattzasann daroo haathia dizza gsaa Yaansay asa xaamakchhn asayyka izzko biidi xmaqettdess. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hesa woode Yannsaay buro qaacho kketha gelii beyyna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hee wode Yaansassne isi isi ayyhudea asat. garrsane Ayyhudata gessa wooga gesii gtta polamaay denndidess. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yannssa kallisayta izakoo shiqqdie “asstamare nenara Yorrdanose shaafa pinnthane neenrra issifa dishhn ne iza gess marrkatoo adezikaa heko xaamaqess asaayka izika bess gdda.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yannsaayka isstas hzzgdess. “o7nnsika Xoossafe imetonta dishnn ayykoykka dana dandaeena. <verse number="28" style="v"/>&lt;Tani izafe snthataa kitadiis atin yana Krrstossay tana gdikke&gt; gada ta intees yotooysas inte inte huerra taa marrkataa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Machii msshray dzadey izika msshra msshra lageey gdikko msshraza achaan ekkdi Msshrazzi gzazz siyees. msshrraza xxalla siiydi ufaeetess hessa gssha ta uhaaththaaysi hii polltdess. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Izi xooqu xooqu ganamala taaka zqqi ganamalla koshees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Puudape yezadey wursofe boola. garrsa biitafe gedidaay izi bitazanne biitaaz yootees (hasaees) saloope yesadeey izi wursofe bola. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Izi ba beeydazine ba siiydazz markariis gdoo atiin zia marrsatiths ekkzadeey deena. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iza marrkethe ekkzadeey gddko Xoossa tumanncha gdidaaysa qonncsees (besees) <verse number="34" style="v"/>Xoossa kittdadeey Xoossa Qalla yotiss Xssika izades ba ayana kunnthie imess. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Awaay ba na dosees haanizza yoo wurrsi iza kuseen yeegdees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nazaan amanizades medaana deyooy dees. nazaan aamanontaay gediiko Xoossa hankooy iza bola dees attin deyoo demena.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He woode Yesussay Yanssapa bollara daaro asa bena kalizadey othizayssane xammaqzayssa Paarssaweti siyyda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gido attn xmmaqizayti iza kalizzytape atin izi xmmaxxbeyna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iza gish hasettizaysa Paarsaweti siyydayssa Yesussay eerdi Yihhudda derre aggdi Gaalia dere simmi bidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Izi he bishshin Sammaryara adhi busi izas dosa gidoonta maane gidides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Heesa gissh Sikkaro getettizzaso Smmarya Katamma bidees. Sikkara Yaqoobeey ba naa Yoosehaaththaos imida bita achan daysu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Henika Yaaqobbe hatha olay dees. Yesussay o7gge haamutti dabburidi gish he o7llay achchan uttidees. Wodeykka gllassape usuppune Ssaate mala. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hesaa woode isi Saammarya dere Mccash dizaara haathe tikkanas he hatha tikanas he hatha olakko yaddus. Yesussyka izo “tana haath ushsha” gides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessi hanishin Yesusaa kallizzayta qumma shshamana kattamma bida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hinna sammarrya Maacashaya Yesussa “ne Ayyhhuda Assi gida utada waanaada tana saammariyya machchas &lt;hathe ushsha&gt; ga o7ychazii?” gadus. Iza hessa gidaay Ayyhhudda Assasinne Sammarriya asa gagoteththi donnta gishasa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesussayka Izis “Xoossa iimotaayne nena &lt;tana hathe uusha&gt; gizzadey izi o7naakone ne eeriazzko ne iza woosana beses. Izika ness deeyo hath nees immanakoshin” gides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izaka Izas hizgadus. “Goodo nees hath duqqza miishi deena haththa olaykka darro cimma, histin ne deeyo hatha Awaappe demmane? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ne haayssa haththa o7llazza nuus immida nu Aawwa Yiqqoobeppe Addazzi Izzine iza nayti iza mmhhetikka haaysa ha o7llape haath uyydaa.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesussay izis hizgidees “hayyssa ha haththafe uyzzaye wuri namma7nthoo ssamottidi zari hara uyaanashshn. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta imizza hath uyzzadey medhinas mulleka samoottena. Gssoykka ta immiza hath uyizzades medhina deyoos ppulttiza puullto hath gidana.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Maccashshayaka “Goodo heeyssafe guye tanna heththi saammonta mallane qaseesaka ta heththi tikkana ha yonnta mmalla hessa ne giza haththa malla hathth tass imaarrkii!” gadus. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesussayka izo “baadane ne azzinna xega ekkada ya” gides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Maaccashayakka zaradaa “tas azinnay deena” hizgiin Yesussay hizgidees “ &lt;ne tas azzinay deena&gt; guussay tumukko.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gasooykka kase nes iichachuu azznati detes, qasse ha7i nenara dizzayyssi ne azzina giddenaa, hessa gish ne tummu gaddasa.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Maccashaya izas hizgadus “Goodo neni nabe gdisayssa ta ha7i erraddis.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kasse nu awwatti haayssa zumaa bolla gooynidaa. Innte qasse “Assaye gooynnanass besizzasay Yerrussallamekko geista.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesussaykka izzis hizgides “hanne maaccashshaye Xoossa aawas haayysa zuma boolla woykko Yerrussallamen inte gooynnota wodey yanaysa amaana” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Intene inte eroonta Xoossas goyynetta. Nu gidikko asas atootethi Ayyhudeppe giddida gishsha nuni nu erriza Xoossas goyynos. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido atin tuumu goynnizzayti Xoossa aawas Ayyananinne tumatethan goynizza woddey buuro yaanna. Haray atoshshn haiikka yiddes. Xoossa aawaykka kooyzay heesa malla gooyniizaytta. <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Xossi ba hu7es a7yanna. Iza goynizayti aynaninne tumatethan gooynanass beesees.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Macashayakka “Xossay tiyidade Kirstosay yanaassa ta errayys, izi yiidi haniizzaz wurrsi nuus yoottana” gaddus. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesussayka izis “hii neenara hssaizzay ta izzakko.” giddes. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessi haniishshin izza kallizzayta ba biddassoppe simmida. Yesussay Maaccashshara hassa7izaysa maallalletida. Giddo atiin “hane a77y kooyazi? wykko haniira a7zzas hassazz?” giiddi o77nikka oychchana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessafe guuyye Mccashshaya otooza hen agagada geede kattama bada, asas. <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Ta oththidaz wurrssi tass yottdadey ha yiddi beeyte, oone erazzy yanna Xossay tiyida Kirstosay izakkonne!” gadus. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Assayka kattamape kezzidi Yessusako bides. <verse number="31" style="v"/>He wode Yesussa kalizzyti Yesussa “Asstamarre qumma ma” gdii wossida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Izi qaas “inte eronttay ta mizza qummay tas dees.” gidees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hssa gsha iza kalizayti “aykko miza kathth asii izas ehideshsh” giidi ba grrssan hasaeetda. <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Yesussayka istas zaridi ta quumay tana kiitda ta aawa shene o7thone iza ootho polo” gides. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Inte qaas “kaththa mxxay gkkans buro o7yddu agnna a7tddes gista gideketi? Qaas ta gidikko intena &lt;doqu giidi kaththay maxaa gakiidaysa xeelitee.&gt; gays. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Maxxizadey ba damussa ekaana, medhianas gidizza ayfe shishana, hessagish zerizzadeynne maxizadeey isfe ufe7istana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hesa gsha isadey zerana hara uray maxxana getettiza lemusooy tuuma. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ta intena inte daburontayssa maxnamalla yedadis. Harati oothon daburida gido attin inte ista dabursan go7etidista.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mcashaya “ta oothidazi wurrsi tas izi yootides” gada asas marrkatida malla katamape daroo Samariya asay izan amanides. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hesagisha Samarriya asay Yesussako yidine istakoon gmaa7nmalla wosiida. Izikka nma7u gallas hen gamides. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iza Qalla siydi daroo asay Iza amaanides. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Macashayokka “ha7i nu iza amanizzay ne yootida qalla gish xalla gidonta nuuka nu baggra izape siyyda gishane tumaappe izi derre ashshizade gididaysa erida gishasa” gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussy Shumezza naaza pathides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesusay Samariyan nm77u gallasa gam7idappe guye Galillaa bidess. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Izi ba baggra “nabey ba derren boonchistan” gi yootides. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Gido atn izi Gallila bin Gallia asay Iza loo7ethi mooki ekkides. Gasoykka pazziga Ba7ale boonchana Yerusalame bidason hen dishshin izi oothidaysa wurrsi deyyda gishshasa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hessafe guye yesussay hathe Wayyne cajje oothida Gllilla derre garrsan dzza Qanna getittza ktama namantho bidees. He wode Qifrnahomen izas nay sakettida isi kawo shuumey dees. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Izika Yesussay Yihudda dereppe gede Galilla yidayysa siydi Yesussako bidees. Yesussay dugge Qifrnahoome wodhanmallane daroo saketdii haykqqana gizza naaza pathanamalla Yesussa woossidees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesussaka izas “inte gita malatatanne malallsizaaz beyoonta aykokka amanekkta” gidees. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Shumezikka zaridi “Godoo ta naazi hayyqoonta elela woodharkki?” gides. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesussaka iza “neni ne soo ba nazi paxideess.” gidess. Adezikka Yesussay izas yootida Qalla amaniidi soo smmi bides. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Izi soo bishshn iza ahskkarati izara ogen gagidi “ne nazi paxideskoo.” gidi izas yootida. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Shumezika nazi ay saten paxxidakoone issta zari oychchides. isstikka izazs “qama gllasappe Lapuun Saten iza michchizayssi agides” gida. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Naza awaykka Yesussay “ne naazi paxidees” giday he issti izass yotizza woode gidaysa eriddess. Hessa gshsha he galassfe oykkdi izine iza so asay wuri Yesussa ammidda. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hayssi malattay Yesussay Yihudappe Galila yiidi oothida nma77antho malata.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay issi toy silidade paththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesafe kalidi Ayhudista Ba7lley dizza gish Yesussay Yerussallame bideess. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yerusalamen doorsi gelizza pennge achchan iibrawista qalara Betesayda getettza issi pulltoofe shiqqida eloo hathey dees. Bollara kamay diza ichachu o7geti dettes. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Daro hargganchatti, ayyfe qooqeti, to woobetinne to silati ogge bolla zinniidi hathay qaxistana gakanas nagetees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Isi isi woode Goda kiitanchay hathan woodhidi hatha qaththes. haththa qathafe kaldi koyrottdi hathan gelizza hargganchay bena sakiza ay hrggefekka paxes. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hen gadaan heedzdzu tammane oosppun laythth kumeth sakketida isadeey dess. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yessusay Adezza hen zin7idayssa beyddine izi daro laythth saketdayssa eridi “ne paxxana kooyaz?” gidess. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hargganchazika zaridi “Godo haththay qaxxetiza woode tana hathan gelththiza assi dena, ta buroo bana gishshin harray tape kaseti hathan gelles.” gidess <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesussayka Iza “dendda ne zin7ida algga tookada ba” gidess. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Adezzikka herakka paxxides. Be algga tooki ekidii bidess. Hessi hanidayy Ayhudista sambbata galassa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hesa gish Ayhudista hallaqat paxxida Adezza “hach Sambbattara ne algga tokkana mala Musse wogay azazena” gida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izikka Isttas “ne zini7ida algga tookkda ba gi yotides” gides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Isttikka “nena algga tookkada ba giday oonne?” gi oychchida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Deerey darida gishinne Yesussay hepee hakki bida gish iza oonni paththidakonne adezzi eribeyna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesussay Adeza Xoossa keeththan demmidi “hekoo ha7i ne paxadasa kaseysafe Adhizza iita miishi ne bolla gakontta mala nam77anththo nagara othofa” gides <verse number="15" style="v"/>Adezikka bidinne iza pathiday Yesussa gididaysa Ayhudista dannatas yotides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Adezza sambbata gallas pathida gish Ayhudista dannat Yesussa oykkana yedi godida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesussayka isstas “ta aaway wurso wode oothes, takka othana” gides <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hesa gason ayhudista dannat Yesussa wodhana malla kaseppe aththi denththethida, qase izi sammbatta morida gish xalla gidontta “Xoossi ta aawa” gida gishshinne bena Xoossara ginssida gishasa.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa na Goodateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesussay isttsa hizgi zarrides “ta intes tummu gays aaway oothishin be7idaysa othoppe attin nazi ba shenen ayne otheena. Aaway othizaysa iza nay hessathoka oothes. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gasoyka Aaway naaza doses ba othzaysakka wursi iza besees, inte malaletontta mala hayssafeka adhiza ootho buro bessana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Aaway haqqidayta denththizaythone deyoo imizaysatho nazika hessathoo ba koydades deyoo immana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aaway oonna bollaka pirdeena gido attin pirda maata wuris ba nazas imiddes. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izi hessaththo oththiday asay wuri aawa bonchana malane qaaseka nazaka bonchana malasa. Naza bonchonttay naza kitida aawakka boncheen. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta intes tumma gays ta qaalla siyzadeesine tana kitidaden amanizades medhina deyooy dees, izadeey hayqoope gede deyoon pinnidees atin iza bolla pirdetena. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays kase hayqqida asat Xoossa na qaala siyza woodey yaana, he woodiyakka haano, siyzatii wuri deyoon deyaana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Gasoykka aaway ba bagra deyooy diza mala nazikka ba baggara deyooy dana mala oothides <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izi asa na gidida gish pirdana mala Godatethth izas imiddes. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Haysan aykokka malaletoppite, Gasoykka buro kase hyqdii dufoon dizaayti wuri Iza qaala giireth siyizza woodey yana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lo7o oothdayt hayqqope denddid paxxna, Iita othidaayti gidikko hayqoope denddidi pirdistana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussas markkatida asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Ta ta sheenen ayne oththanas danddaike, gido attin ta ta aawape siyda mala pirdays, tana kiitidaysa sheene oththaysi attin ta sheenen ta oththontta gish ta pirdan balay bawwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tan ta gish tarkka markkatiko ta markkay tummu gidena. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Gido attin ta gish markkatizzadey haraay dees, izika ta gish markkatizzade, markkatethay tummu gididdaysa ta eraays. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Inteni Yanssako asse kitideistashin izika tummu markkatidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ta hayssa gizay inte attana mala attin tas haara ass markkateth koshshida gish gideena. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yanssay exidii pooizaa poo7 mala, intekka gutha wode iza poo7in uhaaththaaettana kooydista. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Tas gidikoo Yanssa markkatethape adhiza markkaay dees, ta markkayka ta aaway tas immida oothok, hesika ta oothiza othooy ta aaway tana kitidaysa tas markkates. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tana kitida ta Aawayka ba huera tas markkatidees, inte gidiko iza qaala giireth mulekka siybeykkista, izas medhoka mulera beybeeykkista. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Izi kitidadden inte ammanontta gish iza qaalay inte achchan deyeena. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Intes geesha Maxxaafatape medhina deyoo demanas milatin maxaxafata piqqilista, maxxaafatikka ta gish markkatetes. <verse number="40" style="v"/>gido attin inte deyoo demaanas tako ha yana kooyekkista. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ta asappe boncho kooykke. <verse number="42" style="v"/>ta intena errays, xoossa siqqoy intenan baynddaysa errays. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tan ta aawa sunththan yadiis shin inte tana mooki ekiibeykeista hara uray qase ba sunththan yikoo inte iza mokii ekista. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Inte inte garssan isay isape boncho koyzzaytoo issi Xoossafe betizza boncho koyonttaytoo inte waanidi tana amaanana danddaeti,? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ta aawa sinththan intena moottanay intes tana misatoopo intena moottanay inte iza uhaaththaaysi oothiza Musekko, <verse number="46" style="v"/>Museey ta gish xaafidaysa ammanidako inte tana ammanana. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Izi xaafidaysa inte ammanontta agikoo qase ta qaala inte woostti ammanane?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay ichchachu shi dere muziides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesussay xiibradoose geetettizaso gaalila abbafee he pinthth pinnidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesussay hargganchata paththida malata beydda gish daroo asay iza kaaliides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesussay bena kaalizaytara pude zumma bolla kezii uttddes. <verse number="4" style="v"/>He woode Ayhudaata paziiga ba77eley matii utdees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>He woode daroo derey Izakoo yizayssa Yesussay dhoqu gi xeeliidi pilphphossa “hayssa deeras gidana quuma awapee shammana danddaiizoon?” gidess. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesussay Pilphphoossa hessathoo oychchiday iza paccanako, gido attin izi ba ooththanaysa erress. <verse number="7" style="v"/>pilphphossayka izas “issi issi urras issi bars gidza kath shamizakooka numm7u xeetu dinaren shaammida kathka hayssas gidena” gidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesussa kalizaytape isay siimoona Phxroossa isha Indryaassa, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ichchachu bangga ukethine namm7u mole oykkida issi nay hayssan dees, gidoo attin hana hayssa ha derezaas awa gakane?” gidees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesussayka zardii “asa wuris utssite” gides, hen gadan daroo maatay diza gish asayka uttides, asa qoodayka ichchachu shi gidizaytako. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hesafe guyee Yesussay uketha ekidi galata wossa wosidi uttdaa asas gishshides, molezaka hessathokaa gishshechides asay wurkka bes gidiza demiides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Asay wurikka kaalli miin Yesussay bena kallizayta “maaddan attidaa kaththa isinooka ashoontta shishshite” gidees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isttika asay mishshin ichchachu ukethafe attida tammane namm7u leemate kumeth shishshida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asayka Yesussay ooththida malata beyydi “hayssaadey tummape ha allame yana nabezakko” gidess. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Asay qase wolqara Yesussa kawothana qopidaysa a erridi Yesussay qaseka isttafe haki bidi zumma bolla kezzdes.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay abba bollara hamutidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gadey qaammishshin Yesussa kalizayt duge abbakoo woodhida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wogolon geliddi qifiranaahone bana kezzda. istti kezshshn gadeey dhumiidees, Yesussay hessa gakanaskka isttakko yibeyyna. <verse number="18" style="v"/>wolqama carkkooy carkkiiza gish abbay keez qaaxides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iza kallzayt baga saate ogge mala wogoloza lagidape guyee Yesussay abba balara toora hamutti wogolozakoo mattishin demmidi baabbida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Izika isttas “tankoo! baboopte!” gidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Isttika iza uhaaththaayysara gede wogoloza gi doo ekkana koyda, heraka wogolozika istt banaso gakides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay asass deyoo quuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abbafe he pinththan attida asay wonttetha gaalas abba bolla issi wogoloy xaala dizarro beyyda, Yesussa kalizayyt kase berkka bidayssane Yesussay isttara wogolon gelonttaaysa erridda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido attin hankko wogolot xiibradoosepe denddidi Yesussay galata wosaa woosidi asa kaththa muzooso achchi yida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asayka Yesussay woykko iza kalizaytti hen baynddaysa beydii he wogolotan gelidi yesussa koshuu Qifranahomee bides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Abbafe he pinththan iza demmidi “asttamare! ne aydee hayssa yadii” gidda. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas “ta intes tumma gayys inte tana koyzay kath mi kaallida gish attin malata be7ida gish gideena. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Dhayaana kaththas oosofite, gido attin hessafe athid xoossa aaway ammaanithza mattame iza bolla shoccida gish asa nay intes immiza medhina deyoos gidiza kaththas ooththite.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>isttika iza “histtin Xoossa ooso ooththanas nu azi ooththino?” gida. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesussayka “Xoossa oosoy Xoossi kiitida iza nazan ammano.” gidii isttas zaardes. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Isttika izas “nu beyddi nena ammanana mala ne nuna aaza malata beesane? qaseka azi ooththane? gides. <verse number="31" style="v"/>&lt;Istti maana mala isttas qumma salope immides&gt; geeteti xaafetida mala kase nu aawati baazoo bittan maan7e miida.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas. “ta intes tummu gays salope wodhida qumma intes imiiday musse giddena, tummu qumma salope intess immizaay ta aawakoo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Gasooyka Xoossa qummay salope wodhidi allamees deyoo imiizaysako” gides. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hesa gish asay “Godo hessa mala qumma nuss wuriso wode immarkkii” gides. <verse number="35" style="v"/>yesussayka isttas hizigidess “deyoo qummay tana, taakko yiza urray mulleka gafeetena, tana ammaaniizadeey aydeeka samotena. <verse number="36" style="v"/>kase ta intes gida mala inte tana beyddistashin ammanibeeykista. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ta aaway tas immizaay wurkka taakko yana, takoo yizade ta gedee kaare goodike. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gasoykka ta salope wodhiday tana kitidaysa sheene ooththanas attin ta sheene ooththanas gideena. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Tana kitidadeey sheene tas immidaytape issadeeka dhaysontta wurisetha gaalas ta denththana. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ee ta sheeney naza beydii iza ammanizadeey wuri medhina deyoo demmanasiko, tanikka wuriseththa gaalas iza hayqqope denththana.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hesa gish Yesussay “salope wodhidda qummay tana” gidda gish ayhudat iza bolla zuzumeetida. <verse number="42" style="v"/>“hayisii Yoseefoo na Yesussa gideene? iza aawane iza aayoo nu errokoni? histtin hai izi &lt;salope wodhadis&gt; waani gizze?” gida. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgides “inte intee garrisaan gugummista. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Tana kittida ta aaway xeeygidape attin takoo yana danddaizadeey oonikka dena, berika takoo yana danddaizay oonikka dena, takoo yizadeka wurisetha gaalas ta iza hayqqope denithana. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nabbista maaxxafatan asay wuri Xoossafe tammardade gidana geetet xaafeetidees, hessa gish aawape siyydi tammarda assi wuri takoo yana. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hesa guus aawa beeyda assi dess guusu gidena. aawa beeyday Xoossa achchafe yidaysa xaala. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ta intees tumma gays tanan ammanida asas medhina deyooy dees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Tan deyoo qumma. <verse number="49" style="v"/>kasse inte aawat bazzo biittan man7e midda gido attin wurkka hayqqida. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Salope wodhida qummay hayssa, hayssa mizzadey mulleka hayqqena. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Salope wodhida deyoo qummay tana, hayssa ha qummape mizzadey wurkka medhinas dana, allames deyoo gidana mala ta immiza qummay ta ashshoko.” <verse number="52" style="v"/>Hesa wode Ayhuddat “haysi addeez nu iza ashsho mana mala woostt iimane?” gidi ba garssan palameetida. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesussay istta hizzigidees “ta intes tummu gays, asa na ashsho inte moontta aggikko iza suththika uyoontta aggikko intes deyooy deena. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ta ashsho mizza urasine ta suththu uyzaa uraas wurisoos medhina deyooy dees, taka izzade wuriththetha gaalas hayqqope denththana. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Gasooyka ta ashshoy tummu qumma, ta suththayka tummu ushsha. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ta ashsho mizzayne ta suththu uyzzay wuri tanan deeyana, takka izzaden deeyana. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Deyoo aaway tana kiitida malane takka izzan deyoon diza mala hessathoka ta ashsho mizzadey wuri tanan deyoon dana. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Hessa gish salope wodhida qummay hayssa, izika kase inte aawat midaaysa mala gidena, gasooykka he qumma midayt hayqqida, ha qumma mizayt gidikoo medhinas dana.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesussay hayssa Qihaaththairanahomeen ayhudata woosa keeththan tammirisiza wode yotiddes.</para>
  <para style="s">medhina deyoo qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Iza kaallizaytape darzzayt hessa siydii “haysi yoozi dexxoko hayssa oonni ekkane danddaize?” gida. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Yesussayka iza kaallizayt hessa yooza gish zuzumetidaysa ba wozinan erridi “&lt;haysi intena dexxize?&gt; gidees. <verse number="62" style="v"/>Assa nay Kirisitoossay ba dizzaso simm kezshshin beykoo inte ay gane? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Assas deyoo immizzay Xoossa ayanakoo, asa wolqay qaasse aynee go77ena, ta intes yootida qaalay deyoo immiza ayanakoo. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Gido attin inte garisan issi issi ammanoontta asat detes. Yesussay isttas hessa giday koyroope dommidi istta garisan ammanoonitayti oonanitakoone qaasse iza aththi immanadeeyka oonakoone erriza gishaskko. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Kallethidikka Yesussay aawa sheeney bayyndda takoo ha yana danddaizadeey dena gada ta intes yootiday hessassa.” gidees. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Hesafe denddidayssan iza kallizaytape daroot guyee simmida, he gaalasafe dommidi Yesussa kaalo aggida. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesussay bena kalliza tammane namm7ista “inteka bana kooyet?” gides. <verse number="68" style="v"/>Hessa wode Simoonna geetettiza phxxirossay “Godo ne medhina deyooy dishin nu oonakoo banee? <verse number="69" style="v"/>Ne geshsha Xoossa na gididdayysa erridi nun ammanidos” gidees. <verse number="70" style="v"/>Yesussayka istta “ta intena tammane namm7ista doorabeykina? histtin intefe isaay Xallaeko.” gidees. <verse number="71" style="v"/>Izi hessa giday Simoona na Asqqoroto Yuddaa gishasiko. ayysi gikko yudday tammane namm7istape iisa gididdakoka Yesussa athth immanay iza gididda gishshasiko.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay daase ba7alles Yerusalame bides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesussay galila garssan yuyettdees, gido attin Yuhudan yuyanas kooybeeyna, gasooykka Ayhudat iza wodhana kooyza gishshasiko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He wode Ayhudata dase Ba77eley matti uttdes. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hesa gish Yesussa ishshati izakoo shiqqidi hizzigida. “nena kallizayt ne ooththiza oosoza beyana mala ne heyssafe denddada Yuhuda dere ba. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gasooykka qooccen erristana koyzadey ba ooso geeman oothena, neka heytantta wursa ooththashe nena allamen qoonccsana koshshes.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Istt hessa gida gasooy iza ishshataka gidin izan ammanonttayta gidida gishshasiko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzigides. “ta wodey buroo gakiibeyna, inte wodey gidiko wuriso wode intes gigako. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Deerey intena ixxana danddaena, tana gidikoo ixxes, gasooyka ta allame oosoy iita gididdaysa izas markkattza gishshasiko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hai inte gede ba77elezaso bite, tass wodey gakontta gish hayssa ha Ba77elezaso bikke.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hesa gidii Yesussay Galilan attdess.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay dase Ba77eleson beetidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gido attin iza ishshat Ba77elezaso bidappe guye Yesussay qonccera gidontta qotara ba77elezaso bidees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ayhudat iza “awan diize?” gishe Ba77elezason koydda. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Deereyka Iza gish garisara sasuqi hasaettdes. issi issi asat “izi loo7o asakoo” gishin bagay qase “loo7o gidena izi dere baleththes” gides. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gido attin Ayhudata dannatas babiza gish oonnika iza gish qoonccen hasaibeyna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ba77elezii wurana baaga gakishin Yesussay xoossa keeth bidi tammariso oykkdees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ayhudat “haysii addezi tammarontta dishshe hayssa wursi woostti erride” gidi malaletidda. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesussay hizzgdes. “ta tammarithiza timmiritey tana kittda ta Aawape immetides attin tape gidenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tana kittdaysa sheene ooththana koyzadeey dikko haysii ha timmiritey Xoossafe beetdaysa woykko ta tape hasaidaysa gidikkoka errana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bepe hasaizadeey ba boncho koyyes, kittidade boncho koyzadeey gidiko izi tummancha, wordooy iza bolla denna. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mussey intes woga immidess gideene? gidikkoka inte garisan wog nagii poliidadey oonka deena, inte azass tana wodhana koyeti?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Deereyka iza “ne bolla dayydanthth dees! ne wodhana kooyzay oonne?” gidees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgi zarides “ta issi ooso ooththadiss inte wurikka hano ha oosoy malaleteista. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musseey intes qaxxara woga immidees, he wogayyka immeetiday kase aawatape beetidees attin Mussepe gidena. histtin hekko intekka sambbatta gaalasiika asse qaxxarista. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Histtiko Musse wogay sharetontta mala assi smbbata gaalas qaxaretiysa gidiko histtin ta sambbata gaalas asas kummetha asateth paththiin azzas ta bolla hanqqetet? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Suurre pirda pirdite attin asa ayfeso xeelidi maadoo pirda pirdofite.”</para>
  <para style="s">kirisitosa gish denddida pallam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yerusalame asape issi issi asat hizzgda “istt woodhana koyza addezii hayssa gideene?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>heko izi qoonccen hasaees shin istt iza aykooka gibeytena, haysii xoossay kittidade giddidaysa dannat tummu eerizoshsha? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Histtin haysii addeezi awa asakone nu erroos, xoossay kitiddadey yishshin qaasse izi awapekone errizadey oonnika deena, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hesa gish Yesussay xoossa keeththan tammarththishe ba qaala dhoqu histtdi “inte tana tummu errata, ta awape yidakone inte errata, gido attin tan ta sheenen yabeykke, tana kittdaysi izi tummancha, gidoshin inte qasse iza errekkista. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta gidikoo iza achchafe yida gishshine izi tana kittda gish ta iza errays” gidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hesa woode iza oykanass koydaa, gido attin buroo wodey gakibeyna gish oonnika oykkbeyna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido attin derezape darooy izan ammanides, asay hizgidees “xoossay kittiddadey yizza wode haysi addezi ooso malatape bollaara hara ootthhane?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussa oykkana wootadaret kittetda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Assay Yesussa gish garssara sasuketi hasaishshin Parssawet siyda, hessa gish qeessista halaqatne parssawet yesussa oykkanas Xoossa keethth pengge naggizayta yediida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>He wode Yesussay “ta intenara guuththa wode dashshana, hessafe guye tana kittidaysako simma bana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Inte tana koyana shin demekkista, inte ta dizzaso yanas danddaekeista.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hesa gish Ayhudata dannat ba garssan issay issara, “haysi addezii nu demmontta mala awa baneshsha? oonne errizzay Girikista giddo laleti diza Ayhuddatakoo bidi Girikista tammarisanesha? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Izi &lt;inte tana koyana shin demekkista, ta dizasoo inte yanas danddaekista gishin hes ay gusee?&gt;” gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Deyoo hathth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ba77eleeza wurithetha gita gaalas Yesussay dendidii eqqidne ba qaala dhoqu histtdii “hethth sammottda urray dikoo ha taakko yidi uuyoo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Maxxafay gida mala tana ammanizadefe deyoo haththa pullitooy pullitana.” gidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Izi hessa gidaay izan ammanizayt buropee ekkana xiilo ayana gishshasiko, gasooyka yesussay boonchetza wodey buroo gakontta gish xiilo ayanay buroo qoonccoontta immetibeyna.</para>
  <para style="s">Deereza garssan shakketethi medhettdes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessa gish derezape issi issi asat he qaala siydii “yana giza nabey tummape hayssakoo” gida. <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Harati haysii xoossay kittiddadeko” gida. baggayyt qasse “xoossay kittiddadey Gliilape waan yane? <verse number="42" style="v"/>xoossay kittiddadey Dawitte zeereththape yeletanaysane dawitte katamma Bettelemepe yanaysii kase geshsha maxxafan xaafetibeyne?” gida. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hessa gish iza gaason derey ba gidoon shaaketi wodhides. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Isttafe issi issi asat iza oykkana koyda, gido attin oonikka oykibbeyna.</para>
  <para style="s">ayhudata dannat ammanibeytena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessafe guye xoossa keeth naggizayt qeessata hallaqatakone Parisawettako simmid bida, izetika “aazas iza ekontta yidet?” gida. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wootadaretika zaridi “ha addezi hasaizaysa mala ay assika hasai errena” gida. <verse number="47" style="v"/>parssaweti istta “intekka baletidet?” gida. <verse number="48" style="v"/>dannatape woykoo parssawistape iza ammanidayt dizosha? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Haysii mussee woga errontta derey tummape qanggetdaysa. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Haysafe kasse Yesussako bida Parssawistape isa gidida niqoodimoosay isttas <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Nu wogan issi mottetizadey ba mottos malththe immin siyonttane izi ay ooththidakone erretontta dishshin pirday pirdeet errize?” gides. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Isttika “neka galila asse? galilape nabey denddontaysa qoorerethada gakka erraa” gida. <verse number="53" style="v"/>hessafe guye isay isay beso bides.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">laymmatethan oyketida maccashshiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesafe guye Yesussay debrrezaytte bidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wontteththa gaalas malado wonttara xoossa keeth simmii yidess, dereyka wuri izakko yiin izi uttdii istta tammariso oykides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Musse woga tammarisizaytine Parssawet issi laymatethan oyketda maccashsh dizaro eeki yidi dere sinththan eesida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesussayka hizzgdes “Asttamare! heko hana maccashshaya laymatashe oykistadus.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hani mala maccashi shuchchan cadista hayqana mala mussey nu wogan nuna azazides, nech? hani gish ay gay? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Istt iza hessa giday iza bolla mottos gidiza gasoo demanasine iza paccana koyda gishshasa, gido attin Yesussay hokkdi biita bolla ba biradhera xaafoo oykdes. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Istt iza shir shir oychchin dhoqu gidi “inte giddofe nagaray bayndda urray koyro shuchchu izi bolla halo” gides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>hessafe qasseka hokidi biita bolla xaafides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Isttika hessa siydii cmatape oykkdi wurkka isay isay bi kichchida, hessa gish Yesussay hen eqqida maccashshayra xaala attdes. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hesafe Yesussay dhoqu gidi “hane maccashshaye nena mottizayt awan dizo? ne bolla pirdadey oonikka baye?” gides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izaka “Godo oonikka baawa.” gadus. Yesussayka “taka ne bolla pirdike, ba! Namm7enththo nagara oosofa.” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay deres poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>qasse Yesussay “ta derey poo7o, tana kaallizadey wuri deyoo poo7o demmana, dhuman simerettena.” gidi isttas yootdes. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Parssawet “nenii ne gish markkatasa, ne markkaay tummu gideena” gida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgi zaarides “ta ta gish ay markkatkoka ta awape ydakoone qasse ta awa banakoone ta erriza gish ta markkateth tummako, inte gidikko ta awape ydakoone qasse awa banakoone inte erreketta. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inte ashsho qoofa mala pirdista, ta gidiiko oonna bollaka pirdike. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ta pirdikkoka ta pirday tummu pirda, gasooyka ta tarkka pirdike, tana kittda ta aawayka tanara dess. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Namm7u asatta markkay tummu gididays inte wogan xaafetdes. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa gish tan ta gish markkatays, tana kittda ta aawayka tasi markktes.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Isttika “ne aaway awan dizee?” gidi iza oychchida, Yesussayka isttas “tana gidiin ta aawaka gidiin inte errekista, inte tana errizakoo ta aawaka errannakoshin” gidi isttas zardess. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa isttas yootday Xoossa keethth gibben mishshe woththiza saxxine achchan tammarssishshe yootdes, shin izas oykeettza wodey gakontta gish oonnika iza oykiibeyna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesussay qasseka “ta bana shin inte tana koyanane inte inte nagarara hayqana attin ta bizaso bana danddaekista” gides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayhudatika ba garssan isay isara izi “&lt;ta bizaso inte yana danddaekista&gt; gizay berkka bena woodhanasesha?” geetetda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Izi qasse istta hizzgdes “inte garssa asa, tan bolla asa, inte hayssa allamee asa, tani ha allamepe gidkke. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Inte ta oonnakone erridi ammanontta aggiko inte inte nagarara hayqqana gish ta inte! Inte nagarara hayqqana giday hessa gishshaskko.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Isttika iza “ne oonne?” Gida, Yesussayka isttas hizzgdes “hai gaakanas ta isttes iza gish yootzadey tanakko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ta inte bolla hasaizaysine pirdza yooy daroy dees, gido attin tana kittiddadey ammanetdade, taka izape siydaysa ha allamezas yootays.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izi isttas aawa gish yootzaysa akeki beytena. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hesa gish yesussay “inte asa na dhoqu hisittd kaqqida wode he ta gidaddey tana gididaysa inte errana, aaway tana tammarssidaysa yootads attin tan ta sheene mala aykoka oosonttaysa inte akekana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>tana kittdayssi izi tanara dees, ay wodekka ta uhaaththaayzaz ooththiiza gish izi tana xaala yeegi aggibeyna” gidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Izi hessa yootda mala daroo asay izan ammanidees.</para>
  <para style="s">poo77o nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesussay bena ammanida ayhudata hizzgdes “inte tummu ta qaalan dikko inte tummupe tana kaallizayta gidana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tummay azakkone inte erranane tummayka intena geshshana.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Isttika izas zaaridi “nuni Abbrame naytako, nu oonasiika aylleet erroko, histtiin ne nuna waanada inte wozistana gazi?” gida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgdes “ta intes tummu gays nagara ooththizadey wuri nagaras aylle. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ay wodekka aylleey keeththan luxxe deeyena, yeloy gidkko aydeka keeththan deyes. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Histtko nazi intena wozikko inte wozettidayta gidana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Inte Abbramee nayta gididdaysa ta errays, gido attin ta qaala inte erroo gi ekkoontta gish tana wodhanas koyista. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Tan ta aawa achchan be7idaysa ta intes yootays, inte qasse inte aawape siydaysa ooththista.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Isttikka izas “nu aaway Abbrameeko” gidi zari yootin Yesussay isttas hizzgdes “inte Abbramee na giddiko Abbrameetho ooththana shin. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ta Xoossafe siyda tumma intes yootin tana wodhanas qaachch denddidista, gido attin Abbrameey hessaththo ooththibeyna. <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Inte inte aawatho ooththista” isttika zaaridii “nu laymman yeeletida na gidoko, nu aaway issi Xoossa xaala” gidi izas zaarida.</para>
  <para style="s">Xalae nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas hizzgdes “inte aaway Xoossa gididakoo taka Xoossafe keza yida gish inte tana dosanakko shin tana izi kittdes attin ta tarkka ta sheenen yabeykke. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ta yootzaysa ays yuushi qoopeket? gasooyka inte ta qaala siyana koyontta gishshaskko. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Inteni inte aawa xalae nayta, inte aawa ammo polana koyista, izi kasseka shemppo wodhidadee, iza achchan tummay dena gish izi tumman eqiibeyna, izi ba huess wordanchane wordo aawa gidida gish izi wordo hasa7e beepe medhi ekkidi hasaees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ta qasse tummu hasaiza gish inte tana ammanekista. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Inte garssafe tana ne hano nagara ooththadasa gidi markkara laathanas moottana danddaizadey dizee? ta tummu hasaizade gidiko histtin aazas tana ammaneket? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Xoossafe gidida uuray Xoossi giza siyes, inte gidiko Xoossafe gidontta gish xoossa qaala siyekista.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay ba gisha hasaidaysa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayhudatika zaaridi “nu nena ne Sammaryya asa, ne bolla daydanthth dees gooys tummu gideene?” gida. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas hizzg zaarides. “tani ta aawa bonchays attin daydanththi ta bolla baawa, inte gidiko tana kawushshista. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Tan tas boncho koyke, ta bonchetena mala koyzadey qasse dees, izika pirda pirdanadeko. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays, oonnika ta qaala naggikoo hayqqo muleka hayqqena. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ayhudat iza hizzggda. “ne bolla daydanththii dizayysa hai nuni errdees, Abrrameyy hayqqdees, nabetika izatho hayqqda, ne qasse ooniko muleka hayqqoo beeyena ga yootassa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ne nu aawa Abrramepe adhaz? izi hayqqdees, nabettka hayqqda histtin ne nena oonna gaana koyadii? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgdees “ta tarkka tana bonchiko ta bonchoy hada, tana bonchizadey gidiko inte “izi nu Xoossa” gizzay ta aawako. <verse number="55" style="v"/>inte iza errontta aggikoka ta qasse errays, ta iza errike giikoo, taka inte mala wordancha gidays. ta qasse iza errayss, iza qaalaka naagays. <verse number="56" style="v"/>inte aawa Abrramey ta galas beeyanas ammotid beeydeesine uhaaththaaettidees. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Ayhudatii qasse “ness buroo ichchachu tammu layth kummontta ne abrrame beeyadi? gida. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesussayka “ta intes tummu gays, Abrramey yellettanape kase tani tanako.” gides. <verse number="59" style="v"/>ayhudat heraka iza caddanas wuri shuchchu denththida. gido attin Yesussay istta matape qotetidii xoossa keethafe kezi bides.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">yesussay qooqe gidi yelletidaysa ayfe paththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>yesussay ogera adhii bishe ba aay uloope yelletethape ayfee qooqidade beeydes. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iza kallizayt iza “tammarisizays haysi addezii qooqe gidi yellistana mala nagara oththiday oonne? iza yellidaytii oththidoye? izi oththide?” gidii Yesussa oychchida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgdees “iza gidinkka iza yellidaytika nagara oththibeytena, izi hessaththo haniday Xoossa oththoy iza bolla qonccanasiko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gaalasara tana kittdade oththo oththanas tas besses, buroo oonnika othanas danddaontta qammay yaana? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha bitta bolla diza wode ha bittas poo7oy tana.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gi simmidi bitta bolla cuchchu cuttdii ba cuchchan urqqa gigsidi addeza ayfeza he urqqa tydii addeza <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Baada selihomen asay xammaqetizason meccista” gides, selihome gusi kittetdaysa gusa, addezika bidi maccetdesine xeellishe simmi yides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iza dosatnne kase izi hen wosishshin be7ida asay “hayssadey kase uttid wosiza addeza gidene? gida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Isttafe issi issi asati “ee izakko” gida, baggaytii “iza gidena” gida, izi qasse “ta izako” gidees. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Isttika “histtin ne ayfey wani xeelide? gidi oychchida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izika zaaridii “Yesussa geetetza assi bitta bolla urqqa urqqasddine ta ayfeza he urqqa tydiine tana baada seliihomen meccista gi yootin ta baada meccistada xeellanas dandda7eds” gidees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Isttaka “histtin he uray hai awan dizee?” gida, izika “ta errke” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Parssaweti addezii wani paxdakone qoroo oykda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isttikka he kasse ayfe qooqe addeza parssawistako ehaaththada. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesussay urqqa urqqasiidii addeza ayfe paththida gaalasay ayhudata sambbata gaalasiko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gish parssawetii addeza izii wostt xeeliidakone iza oychchida, addezika zaaridii “izi ta ayfen urqqa tydees, taka meccistadis, heko hai xeellides” gides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>parssawistape issi issi asati “hays addezi sambbata bonchonttade gidida gish izi Xoossafe gideena” gida, baaggay qasse “nagaranchay hayssa mala malata wani ooththana danddaize? gida, hessa gish istta gidon pallamay medhetides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gish kase ayfe qooqe addezzako simmidi “ha ne ayfe paththida addeza gish ne ay gazz? Gida, addezii zaaridi “izi nabeko” gides. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ayhudati addeza yellida ayeyrane aawara xeeygsi eehisana gakanas addezii kase qooqe gididdaysa ammanibeytena. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Isttka (yelidayta) “inte nusi qooqe nay yelletdes giza nazi hayse? histtin hai wanidi xeelana danddaide?” gida. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yellidaytka hizzgi zaarida “izi nu na gididaysane qooqe gididi yelletdaysa errosu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hai qasse izi wani xeelana danddaidakone iza ayfe oonni pogidakone nu erroko, izi bena danddaidade gidida gish izi ba gish yootanas danddaees, iza oychchitee” gida. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iza yellidayt hessaththo giday oonnika Yesussa izi Kristtossa giidi markkatday wuri ayhudata woosafe godistana mala Ayhudati kase seera oththida gish ayhudatas babidi gida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hesa gish iza yellidayt izi bena danddaidade gidida gish iza ochchte” gida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kase qooqe addeza qasseka xeeygd “hayso ne tummayo yootada xoossa boncha, haysi addezi nagarancha gididaysa nu errosu” gida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izika “izi nagarancha gididaysa ta errike, gido attin ta kase qooqe gididarone qasse hai ta xeelizaro hano xaala errays” gides. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Istt qasse iza “izi nes ay oththide? Ne ayfeza wostt pogide?” gidi oychchida <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izika “ta intes kase yootin wozinan woth siybeykista shin hai qasse aazas zarethi siyana koyetii? inteka iza kalliizayta gidana koyet?” gides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hesafe guye iza “nu musse kallizadentta, ne iza kallizade gida” gi caydda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kase Xoossi Mussera hasaetdaysa nu erros, haysi addezi awape yidakone nu erroko.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Addezika isttas hizzgi zaarides “izi awapekone inte erronttays malalththes, gido attin ta ayfe xeelisdadey iza. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Xoossi bes babizadene iza sheene oththizades attin nagarancha ura siyonttaysa nu eerros. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ayfe qooqidi yelletdade ayfey xeelides gizaysa allamey medhetdasope oonnika siyy errena. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Haysadey xoossafe gidonttako hayssa ooththanas danddaena. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Isttika iza “neni ne Mule asattethay nagaran munuqettin yelletdays ne nuna tammarssana wana xaladi?” gidi iza goodida.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayaanan qooqeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Addeza goodidaysa Yesussay siydes, iza demmidine “ne asa nan ammanyy?” gides. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Addezika “godo ta izan ammanana mala izi oonne?” gidi oychchides. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesussayka “ne iza beyadasa hai nenara hasaizay izakoo” gides. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Addezika “Godoo iza ammanadis” gidi izas hooki goyniides. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesussayka “qooqeti xeelana malane xeelizayti qooqana mala pirdanas ta hayssa allamezan yadiis” gides. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Izara diza parssawistape issi issi asati hessa siydi “hesi ayy guuse? histtin nuka qooqe?” gida. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesussayka istta inte qooqeta gididdakoo intes nagara gidena shin inte hai nu xiiloosu giza gish inte nagaray diza mala dana” gides.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">loo7o hethancha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays, doorssata yire penggerape attin hara baggara guupi geliizaay kaysoone bonqqizzade. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Penggera geliizadey izi doorssata hemmiizade. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Penggee nagzadey izas penggezza doyees, doorssatka iza qaala syeetes, ba doorssata sunththara sunththara xeeygi keesses. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Beyta wursi kessidape guyee istta sinthth adhidi kalethees, doorssatika iza qaala erriza gish iza kaletees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Immatha urra iza qaala errontta gish izafe baqatetes, attin muleka iza kaletena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>yesussay hessa lemisoza isttas yootdes, shin istt qasse izi isttas yootdaysa aykoka erribeytena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>hessa gish yesussay qasseka isttas hizzgdes, “ta isttas tummu gays doorssat penggey tana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tape kasse ydayt wuri kaysoone bonqqzayta doorssat gidkoo istt giza siybetena <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pengeey tana ta, ta bagara gelizadey wuri attana, gelanane kezana hemmetizasoka demmana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kaysooy kaysootana wodhanasine dhaysanas xaala yees, ta gidiko intes deyooy dana malane intes kehi darana mala yadsi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta loo7o hemmizzade, loo7o hemiizzdey ba shmppo ba doorssata gish aththi immees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mishshera qaxxaretdii himmizadey gidiko doorssat izas gidoontta gish sudhumey yizza woode doorssaatii yegidii bess baqaates, sudhumeyka doorssata daf daf meesene laales. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Baqattza mishshan qaxxarettdadee gidida gishine doorssatas michchetonttagishasa gshasa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Loo7o hemmizadeey tana tani ta doorssata errays, isttika tana erretes. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hesika aaway tana errizaysa mala tan ta shemppota doorssata gish aththa immana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hayssa ha doorssa yren geloonttayt tas hara doorssat deetes, ta isttaskka ha ehanaas tas beeses, isttika ta qaala siyanane issi mehe gidana, hemmiizayskka isadee gidana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta zaarada denththanas ta shemppo ta aththa immiza gish ta aaway tana dooses. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tani ta shemppo ta dossara aththa immadsi attin oonnika tape woothii ekkeena, ta aththa immanas gidiin woykoo zaara denththans gidiin sheeney tassa, hessa he azazoza ta ta aawape ekkadis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa he qaalape denddaysan ayhudata garssan qasseka shaketeth medhetdees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Daroo asay “iza bolla daydanthth diza gishine gooshu gidida gish inte izi gizaysa ays syeeti? gida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Baaggayti qasse “haysii daydanththi dizaddey hayssa mala gideena, daydanthth qooqda ayfe paththi errize? gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudati ammanoontta exxoo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yerusalamen xoossa keehta oratho ba77ele boncho woodey gakkides, woodeyka gaalas. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesussay Xoossa keethth giibe gidon seloomoney simmeretzaso geetetzasora adhishshin. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayhudati iza gidoo aththidi “ne aydee gakanas nu wozzna hirggan gammiisanee? ne Xoos kittidade gidikoo nus qoonccsa yoota gida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgdees “ta intes yootadiskkoo shin inte qasse ammanibeykeista, ta aawa sunththan ta oththiza malatatii ta gish yootetes. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Inte qasse ta doorssata gidoontta gish tana ammanekista. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ta doorssatii ta qaala siyetes, taka istta errays, isttikka tana kaalletes. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta isttas medhina deyoo immana, muleeka istti dhayetena, istt ta kushshepe woththii ekkanas danadey oonnika dena. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tas istta immida ta aaway wurisofee adhes, ta aawa kushshepe istta oonnika bonqqanas danddaena. <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Tanine ta aaway nu issino.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ayhudati iza caadanas qasseka shuchchu denththida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesussayka “aawape gidida daroo gita malatata ta intena bessads, histtin ha ta besidaytape awari gish tana shuchchara caadeti? gides. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ayudatiika “nu nena shuchchara caadizay ne coo asi gida dashe nena nerkka xoossu kessada caashsha qaala ne hasaida gishshasape attin ne loo7o ooththidaysa gish gideena” gidii izas zaarida. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgdes “inte wooga gidon &lt;ta intena xoossata gadis&gt; geeteti xaafetibeyne? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Xoossa qaalay isttas yida asata &lt;xoossu gikoone maxaafay sharistanas danddaontta gidikoo.&gt; <verse number="36" style="v"/>Histtin &lt;ta Xoossa na&gt; gida gish aaway ba shaaki dummasidaysane ha duge allame kittidaysa inte ne caayadasa gidi tana wordo aazas mooteti? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ta aaway ooththizaysa ta oosontta aggkoo tanan ammanopite. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ta izaththo ooththiza gidiko inte tana ammanontta aggikoka ta aaway tanan dizaysa taka izan dizaysa inte errana malane yuush qoopana mala izi ooththida malatan ammanite.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Qasseka istti iza oykanas paacciida shin izi istta kushshepe keesi ekii bidees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesussay, Yanssaay kasse xammaqzasoo gede yoridanosepe he pinthth simmid hen gammides. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Daroo asay izako yides, istti qasse “Yanssay issi malataka ooththibeyna, gidoo attin hayssa addeza gish izi yootdaysi wurikka tummuko” gida. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Henkka daroo asay Yesussan ammanides.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Allazzare hayqqoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bittaniiya gizasoon Marammane diza manddaran Allazzare geetettizadey saketides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Izi ishsha Allazzarey saketda Maramma kase Yesussa to bolla shiito gusada Yesussa to ba huee iththken quccdaroko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hayt michchet “Godo ne dosizaysi saketdes” gidi asse yesussako kittida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa siyd ha sakoy xoossa nay izan bonchetana malane Xoossi bonchetanasafe attin iza hayqqos gaththizaz dena” gides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesussay martta izi michchyo marammone Allazare siqqees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin Allazarey saketdaysa siyy woththdii hen ba dizason namm7u gaalas gammides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye bena kaallizayta “anee Yuhuda bitta simm boosu” gides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Isttika “asttammare! guththa wodepe kasse asay nena shuchchara caadana koyshshina, ne qasse hai hee simma banee? gida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas “issi gaalasan tammane namm7u sateey dees gidenee? Gaalasara hammutiza urray ha allameza poo7on simmeretontta gish dhubetena. <verse number="10" style="v"/>dhubeetzadey gidikoo qamara hammutizadee, gasooyka poo7oy bayndda gishasa.” gides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa isttas yootdape guye “nu lagge Allazarey ziniides, taka iza dhiskkofee denththana bayss” gides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iza kaallizati iza “godoo! izi dhiskkda gidiko denddana” gida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas hessa yootday iza hayqqo gishasa shin ia kallizaytas qasse dhiskko gish yootida milatides <verse number="14" style="v"/>hasa gish qoonccera isttas “Allazarey hayqqdes <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inte ammanana mala ta hen dontta aggdays inte gish tana uhaaththaayses, hai gidiko ane gede izako boos” gides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Qasse Diidmoosa geeetza Toomasay hankoo yesussa kallizayta “ane nuka bidi izara isife hayqqos” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">yesussay Allazare michchista mintheethedes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesussay bi gakishshn Allazarey haqqi moogetin oydu galas gidides <verse number="18" style="v"/>Biitanyaay Yerussalamepe baga satee oge hakes. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Istta ishsha hayqqo gish Marammone martta minththethanas daroo ayhuda asay isttako shiqides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesussay yidaysa Marttay siyada iza mooka ekana badusu, Maramma gidiko soon uttadus. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Marttay Yesussa hizzgadusu “godoo! ne han dizakoo ta ishshay hayqqenako shin. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Haika gidiko ne woosida wursi xoossi nes immanayssa ta errays.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesussayka izis “ne ishshay denddana” gides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Marttay qasse “wurisethan denththa wode izi denddanaysa ta errays” gadus. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesussayka izis hizzgidess “dethine deyooy tanakoo, tana ammanizadey hayqqikoka paxa dana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tanan dizadeyne tana ammanizadey muleka hayqqena, hessa ne ammanay?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izaka zaarada “ee goodo neni duge ha allameza Kitteti Xoossa na gididaysa ta ammanays” gadus. <verse number="28" style="v"/>hessa gadane simmada ba michchiyo Marammo dumma xeeyga kessada “Asttammarey nena koyes” gadus. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Marammaka hessa siyda mala elela denddada izaka badus. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa gakanas Yesussay Marttara gaggdason dees attin gede manddara garss gelbeyana <verse number="31" style="v"/>Marammo minththeethishe izira soon diza Ayudatika maramma puthurkku ga eqqada kezdaysa beydii iza allazare duhaaththao achchan yekkana bizza milatin izo kaallida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Maramma Yesussay dizaso gakka iza demmida mala iza too bolla guhaaththaanada “godo ne han dizakoo ta ishshay hayqqenakoo shin” gadus. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Izane izo kaali yida Ayhudati yekizaysa Yesussay beydi daroo michcheetdii <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Iza awan moggidet?” gidii oychchdes, isttka “godo hayada beeya” gida. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesussayka ayhaaththaunxxdes. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ayhudatika “izi iza ay mala sqqzakoo beeyti” gida. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Istta garssafe issi issi asati haysi qooqe addeza ayfe pogdaysii hayssadey hayqqontta mala oththanas danddaene shin?” gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Allazaree hayqqope denththides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesussay iza wozanay michchetin gede duhaaththaoko bides, duhaaththaozika shuchchara tuccettda gonggollo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Izika istta “shuchcha denththte” gides, hayqqdaysa michchya Marttay “godo izi hayqqin hach oydu gaalas gidida gish xinqqanako” gadus. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesussayka “ne ammaniza gidiko Xoossa boncho beyanddasa gada nes ta yootabeykna?” gides. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hessa gish shuchcha denththida, Yesussayka pudee xeellidi hizzgdees. “ta aawawu ne ta giza siydda gish ta nena galatays. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ne wuriso gaalas ta giza siyzaysa ta errays, gido attin ta hessa giday hayssan eqqda asati ne tana kittidaysa ammanana malasa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa gidape kaallethidii qaala dhoqqu histtdii “Allazare! ha kezza” gidii xeeygdes. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hayqqda Allazareyka kumeththa asatethay moogo mayoon xaxetda mala duhaaththaope kezides, Yesussayka birsh yedite boo gides.</para>
  <para style="s">asay yesussa wodhanas gemman zooretides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessa gish Marammo minththethana yida ayhudatape daroo asay yesussay ooththdaysa beeyd izan ammanides. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Isttafe baaggat bidi Yesussay ooththdaysa parssawistas yootda. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hessa qeessista halaqqatnee Parssaweti Ayhudata duulata shiqqana mala xeeygd, hizzgda “ha addezii daroo dumma malatata oththdade gidida gish nu ay oththko loo7o?” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nu coou gikko asi wuri iza ammananane oroome asayka yidi nu biittane nu asa nupe ekkana.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Istta garssafe isaddey he laythth qeessistas wana halaqqa qayapaay hizzgdees, “inte aykooka errekkista. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Deerey wuri dhayanape dere gish issi urray hayqqkoo loo7o gidanayssa yushsh qoopeeketii.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Izi hessa beepe gidoontta he layth izi qeessistas halaqqa gidida gish Yesussay Ayhuda dere gish sinththafe hayqqanaysa gish yootdes. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Izi hayqqanay He dere asas xalala gidoontta kase laleetda Xoossa naytaka isibolla shishshanasko. <verse number="53" style="v"/>He gaalasafe ha simmin iza wodhanas maqqetda. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesussay he gaalasafe ha simmin Ayhudata garssan qoonccera simmeretibeyna, gidoo attin dugge bazoo bitta matan dizza ehaaththareeme geetetza katamay diza poqqethaso bidi bena kaallizaytara hen tkkides. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ayhudati paziga ba77eley matda mala ba77eley gakkanape kase gesho woga ooththanas daroo asay dumma dumma derepe Yerusalame yidees. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Asay yesussa koyshshe xoossa keeththan eqqdi ba garssan isay isaa “intes ay milatzee? ba77elezas yeenesha?” gides. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Qeessista halaqatine parssawet qasse Yesussa oykanass izi awan dizakoone errizadey isttas mlatana mala kase azazii woththiida.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Biitaniyan shitoo tyetdees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Paziga ba77eles buro usuppun gaalas attishin Yesussay hayqqope denththida Allazarey dizaso biitaniya bides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>hen Yesussas kawo kaththida Marttay iza kawo muzishin izara isife maaddan uttdaytape issay Allazareko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Maramma daroo allo7o wagara shameetda liitroo bagga gidiza geshsha nardoosa shittoo ekka yada Yesussa too bolla gussada tooza ba huee ithkera quccadus, keethaka shittoo sawoy kummidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesussa kaalliizaytape issay Yesussa aththi immana Asqqoroto Yudday hessa ixxid <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Haysi shittoozi heedzdzu xeetu dinares bayzeetdii miishshay aazas manqqotas immetbeynee?” gides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izi hessa giday mishsha shishshza karaxxte oykkzadey iza gididda gish shiqqza mishshafe bees shishshdi goetzadee gidida gishasa, attin manqqotas michchetdii gidena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesussa qasse hizzgdees “haysi shittoozi tas mooggo gaalasas qoofetdaz gidida gish he woode gakkanaas iza ba achchan nagu bochchofte. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Manqqooti ay woodeka intenara detees, gidoo attin inte tana wuriso woode demmekista.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>He woode daroo Ayhuda asati Yesussay hen dizaysa erridi izakoo yida, yidaytkka yesussa xalala koyda gidoontta Yesussay hayqqoope denththida Allazareka beyanaskko. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gish qeessata halaqati Yesussara Allazareka gathii wodhanas ba garssan zooretda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessika Allazare gedoon daroo Ayhuda asay Yesussako bi bidi iza ammaniiza gishasiko.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay bonchon Yerusalame gelides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wonttetha gaalas ba77eleza bonchana yida derey Yesussay Yerusalame yizaysa siydees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Zammba heyththi ekkdi Yesussa mokkan kezzdes, derey qaala dhoqu histtdi hizzgdes “hosaeena!” goda sunththan yiza isiraele kawooy anjjetdade!” <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Kase “hane! xiyonee nayee baboofa! hekoo ne kawooy haree gutte toogdii yess” geetetii xaafetda mala Yesussay hare gutte demmidi toogiides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iza kaallizayti hessa wuris koyyro wozinan woththbeytana, iza gish xaafettdaysane izas ooththetda hanoka wuris Yesussay hayqqope denddidape guye errida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Al77ezare duhaaththaope xeeygidi hayqqope denththida woode ezara isife diza asay iza denththa gish markkattda. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Daroo asayka izi hessa mala giita malata ooththidaysa siydi iza mokkana kezides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gish parssaweti ba garssan isay issa “histtin ay ooththana danddaizoon? Beyte! kummetha derey atoontta iza kaalles” gida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay ba hayqqanaysa kaseti yootdes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Goynanas ba77elezas shiqqda asa garssan girrike dere asatika dettes. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Isttika gaalila garssan diza beete sayda geetettza dere ass pilphphosa geetetzadeko bidi “Goodo nu Yesussa beeyana koyos” gida. <verse number="22" style="v"/>pilphphosayka inddirasas yootdes, inddirasayne pilphphosay bidi Yesussas yootda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesussayka isttas hizzgdes “heko asa nay bonchetza saatey gakkides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays gistte ayfey biitan wodhada hayqqontta coou ga uttko berkka atawus, iza hayqqza gidiko hara daroo ayfawusu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Be shemhaaththao dosizadey dhaysess, hayssa biita bolla ba shemhaaththao ixxizadey gidiko medhina deyooy nages. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tas ooththana koyzadey tana, tas ooththzadey ta dizason dana, tas ooththzade ta aaway iza bonchana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay iza buroo gakkana metto gishine hayqqo gish yootdees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Qasseka Yesussay hizzgdes “heko ta shemhaaththaoya mettotadus &lt;aabo! ha saateype tana ashsha goosha?&gt; ta hizzgonta mala ta yiday hano ha metto saateysiko. <verse number="28" style="v"/>aabo! ne ne sunththa boncha” hessafe kaalid “ta ta sunthth bonchadis, qasseka gujja bonchana” giza qaalay salope yides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hen gadan eqqda asay hessa siydi “daday dadates” gida, baggayti qasse “kitanchako hasaizadey” gida. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesussay hizzgdes “haysi giirethay yiday inte gishasa attin ta gish gidena. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Haysi allamey pirdistana woodey hayssa, hayssa dereza hariza xalaey hai gede kare yegistana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tani dhoqqu gada kaqqetza woode asa wursa tako zaarana.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa yootday izi ay mala hayqqo hayqqanakoo errisanasiko. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Asay qasse “nu woogan xaafettday &lt;xoossay kittidadey medhinas dana&gt; ges histtin ne qasse wanada &lt;asa nay dhoqu gi kaqqistana beses&gt; gazz? ne giza asanay awaysee?” gidi oychchida. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas hizzgdes “hai guutha woodes intenara poo7oy des, gadey dhumontta poo7ora hamutite, qamara hamutzadey izi awa bizakonee errena. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Inte poo7o nayta gidana mala poo7oy dishin poo7on ammanite” Yesussay hessa gidape guye bidi istta ayfepe gemmides.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudat ammanbbeytena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesussay isttas hessa mala malata istta sinththan ooththinkka ayhudat izan ammanbbeytena. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hesi haniday nabe isiyasay “goodo! nu markkatethi ammaniday oonne? Xoossa qaalay ooss qonccide?” gidi <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessa gish ammananas danddaibeytena, gasooyka nabe isiyasay kase hizzgii xaafida gishshasiko. <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Isttii ba ayfen beeydi, ba wozinan yushshi qoopidi simmontta malane izi istta paththontta mala Xoossi istta ayfe qooqisides, istta wozinaka mumisides.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Isiyasay hessa giday xoossay kittidade boncho beeyida gishshasa, hessa gish hessa Yesussay geesh yootdes. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Gidikoka ayhudista halaqatape daroo asay Yesussa ammanides, gido attin istta ayhudata woosa keethafe godontta mala parssawistas babiidi ba ammano qonccen markkatibeeytena. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Istti hessaththo haniday isttas Xoossafe immettza bonchofe aththidi asape immetza boncho dosida gishasa. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesussay ba qaala dhoqu histtdii hizzgides “tana ammanizadey tanan xalala gidontta tana kittdadenkka ammanes. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Tana beeydadey tana kittdadeeka beeyana. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Tana ammanizay wuri dhuman dontta mala ta poo7o gidada hayssa ha allameza yadis. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ta qaala siydi oosonttade bolla pirdanay tana gidike, gasooyka ta yiday dere ashshanas attin dere bolla pirdanas gidena. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Tana koyonttadene ta qaala ekkonttade bolla pirdanadey dees, ta izas yootda qaalay wuriseththa gaalas iza bolla pirdana. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Gasooyka tani coo ta sheeneni yootabeyke, ta gizaysane ta yootza azazo tas immiday tana kittda ta aawako. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Iza azazoy medhina deyoo gididaysa ta errays, hessa gish ta yootzay wuri aaway tas yootdaysako.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay bena kaallizzayta too meccidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He woodeyka ayhudata paziga ba77elepe kase Yesussay hayssa allameza yedidi aawako bana saatey gakkiidaysa erridees, hayssa allamezan diza ba baggata wuris sqqides, wurisethi gakkanaasika dosides. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesussayne iza kaallizayt isife kawo mishshin simmona nay Asqqoroto Yuday Yesussa aththi immana mala xalaey iza wozinan iita qoofa gelththides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesussay aaway izas godateth wursi immidaysane izi xoossa achchafe kezidi yidaysa, qase simmidi xoossako banaysa erress. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gish maada bollafe denddine mayoo qaari woththdi pooxa ekkdi xeesan gixxides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Too meecciza gonggen hathth gujjidi bena kaallizayta too meeche oykkdes, ba gixxida pooxanika meccida tooza quccides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesussay Simmona geetetza phixirosako shiiqn Simmona geetetza phixirosay iza “goodo! ne ta too meccanee?” gides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesussayka “tani ooththizaysa ne hai erraka guyepe qass ne erranddasa” gides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Phixirossayka “ne ta too mulleka meeccaka” gides, Yesussay qasse “ta ne too meeccontta aggiko nesnne tas isifetethi dena” gides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simmona geetettza phixirossayka zaaridi “goodo hessa gidiko tas too xalala gidontta kushshera hueera wursa meecca” gides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesussay qasse “ba asatethi meeccetdades kummetha bollay geshshi gidida gish izas too meechafe attin hara koshshena, inte gesha shin wuri gidekista” gides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesussay “inte wurikka gesh gidekista” giday iza aththi immanadey oonnakone erriza gishshsiko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Istta too meeccidape guye ba mayoo eeki maydii kase ba uttdasoo simmi uttdes, qasse isttas hizzgides “ta intes ay ooththidakone wozinan woththideti? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte tana asttammarene goda gista ta qass asttammarene goda gidida gish inte guusay tummuko. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Histtkoo ta intes godane asttammare gidashe inte too meeccza gidiko inteka inte garssan isay issa too meeccana beses. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta intes ooththdaysa mala inteka ooththana mala ta intes lemmuiso besadis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays ashshikaray godape adhena, kittetda urray kittidadepe adhena. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Inte hayssa erridi ooson peyshshiko inte anjjetidayta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta hayssa gizay inte wurisota gish gidena, tani ta doridayta wursa errays, gido attin ta kaathi midadeey ta morkke gididi ta bolla denddides giza maxaafa qaalay poletenas koshshes. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta hayssa haira intes yootzay izi poletza woode ta oonnakone inte ammanana malako. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays ta kittdadee ekkizzadey tana ekes, tana ekkizadey tana kittdade ekkes.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay bena aththi immanadey oonnakone kasseti yootdes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa gi simmidi kezi qoofan gelidinee “ta intes tummu gays inte garssafe isadey tana aththi immana” gidi qonccen yootdes. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iza kaallizayt hessa izi oonna gish gidakone errontta gish ba garssan isay isara xeeletdes. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iza kaallizzayta garssafe Yesussay siqqiza isay Yesussa achchan uttides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simmona geetettza phixirossay Yanssa sommii besidi “izi oonna gish gizakone ane iza oychcha” gides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gish izi ba qodhe gede Yesussa hayththako shishshidi “godo! izi oonne? gidi oychchdes. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesussayka zaaridi “izadey ta hai budena woxen dhim77eda barssizade” gides, hessa gi simmid budena woxen dhim77i ekkid asiqorotepe yida simmona na yuda barisides. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuday iza badhida mala herakka xalaeey izan gelides, Yesussayka Yuda “ne ooththanays qoopidaysa elela ooththa” gides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa aazas gidakoone maadan uttda asape gelidadey oonnika dena. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yuday mishshe oykizade gidida gish Yesussa kaallizayttape baggat Yesussay yuda ba77elezas koshshizaysa shaama woykoo manqqootas muxata iima” gida milatdes. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yudayka budena badhida mala herakka kezzidi bides, izi bishin gadeey qammako.</para>
  <para style="s">ooratha azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yuday kezii bidape guye Yesussay hizzgdes “asa nay hai bonchetdes, iza gaason Xoossika bonchetdes. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xoossi iza gaason bonchetza gidiko Xoossika iza bonchana, heraka gam77ontta bonchana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ta Naytoo, ta intenara daroo wode gam77ike inte tana koyana ta kase ayhudata halaqattasika “ta bizzaso inte yana danddaekeista gada yootda mala haika intesiika hessaththo yootays. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Inte inte garssan isay isara siqqistana mala ta intes oraththa azazo immays” ta intena siqqda mala inte inte garssan isay isara siqqetite. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Inte inte garssan siqqetkoo inte tana kaallizayta gididayssa asii wuri errana”</para>
  <para style="s">Phixirossay iza kadanaysa yesussay kasetdii yootdes.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Simmona geetettza phixirossay yesussa “Godo! ne awa bane?” gidii oychchdes, Yesussay qasse “ta bizasoo ne hai tana kaalana dandda7eka shin guyepe ne tana kaalana” gides. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Phixirossayka “Godo! ta nena hai kaalanas ays dandda7ikna? haray attoshshin tani ta shemhaaththaoka ne gish aththa immana” gides. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesussayka zaaridi ne ne shemhaaththao ta gish aththa immanee? ta nes tummu gays hachchi kuttooy wasanape kasistada ne tana hedzdzu to kadana” gidi zaaridees.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">yesussay aawako gaththiza ogge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kaalleththdka Yesussay hizzgdes “inte wozinay metotetoofo Xoossu ammanitee, tanaka ammanite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta aawa achchan daroo dusasooy des, hessa gidonttakko &lt;intes danaso gigisanasa ta bana gana shin. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bada ta intes soo gigisidape guyee inte ta dizason dana mala ta simma yada intena ekkana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta biza ogge inte errista.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tomassay “Godo! ne awa bizakoone nu errokoshin, oggezza nu wostt erranas danddaeizon?” gides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesussayka izas hizzgi zaarides “oggeyne, tummay, deyooyka tanakoo, ta baggara gidikofe attin oonnika awako bana urray dena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Inte tana errizako ta aawaka erranakooshin, hia hayssafe guyee inte iza errana iza beeyoka beydista.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pilphphosayka Godo! Ne nu aawa beesiiko nuss gidana” gides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesussayka izas hizzgides “Pilphphosa! hayssa wode gakanas ta intenara deynkka ne tana erriki? tana be7ida urray aawaka be7ides, histtin neni wanada “nuna aawa besa gazi? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tani ta awan, ta aawayka tanan dizaysa ammaniki? ta intes yootza qaala yootzay ta sheene mala gidena, gido attin oosoza wuris ooththizay tana diza aawako. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tan aawan diza mala aawayka tanan dizaysa inte ammanite, akaye gikoo ta ooththiza oththota gishika tana ammanite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta intes tummu gays, tana ammanizadey ta ooththiza ooso oththana, hessafeka aththana, gasooyka tani aawako bana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aaway naza gaason bonchetana mala inte ta sunththan woosidaysa ta intes wursa ooththana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte ay mishsheka ta sunththan woosidaysa wursa ta oththana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay xiilo ayana gish immida uhaaththaayssa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inte tana doosiza gidiko ta azazoyo nagite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tani aawa woosana, izika intenara medhinasa dana mala hara intena menththeththanade intes immana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Haysi minththeththiza ayanay dere asay iza beey errontt gish allamey ekkanas danddaontta tummu ayana gido attin inte iza errata, gasooyka izi intenara diza gishine izi inte gaththan diza gishasa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Aayane aaway bayndda naytta mala ta intena xalala agiike, ta simmada ha inteko yana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Guththa wodepe guye dere asay tana beeyena shin inte gidiko beeyanddista, tani deyoon diza gish inteka deyoon danddeista. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tani ta aawan diza mala inteka tanan dizaysane taka intenan dizaysa inte he wode erranddista. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ta azazoo ekkidi ooththiza urray tana dosees, tana dosiizadeka ta aaway dooses, taka iza dosana, tanaka izades qoonccisana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asqqoroto Yudda gidontta hankko Yuday “Godo! neni dere asas gidontta nuss wostta qonccisane” gides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesussayka izas hizzgdes. “tana siqqizadey ta qaala nagana, ta aawayka iza dosana, nuni izako yana, yidika izadeera isipee deyana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tana dosonttadey ta qaala nagena, haysi inte siyza qaalay tana kittida ta aawa qaalape attin ta qaala gidena. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tani hai intenara dashe hayssa intes yootdes. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Aaway ta sunththan yedana minththethiza xiilo ayanay qass haniza wuris intena tammarssana, ta intes yootoysaka wuris inte wozinan woththana mala maadana <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ta intes sarooteth aggada bays, ta sarootethika ta intes immana, ta intes immiza sarootethi derey immiza sarooteththa mala gidena, inte wozinay hirggofoone baboofo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta bana, badaka intekoo simma yana gada ta intes kase yootidaysa siydista, inte tana doszzako ta ta aawako bizays intena uhaaththaaysanakoshin gasooyka aaway tape adhdhes. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Haysi haniza wode inte ammanana mala hasysa intes kasista yootadays. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hayssa allameza hariza xalaeey yizza wodey gakkiida gish hai ta intenara daroo hasaiike, izi ta bolla aykooka ooththanas izas wolqay deena. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido attin tanii aawa dosizaysa derey errana mala aaway tana azazidaysa ta wursa polana anee hayssafe boos denddite.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay tummu woyne miththa ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qasseka Yesussay hizzgdes “tummu woyne miththa anoy tana, akakilitteza ooththanchay ta aawa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta bolla dishe ayfe immoontta hangge wuris ta aaway qanxxii diigana, ayfiza hangge gujji ayfaana mala qirxxi geshshana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>ta intes yootda qaala gaason inte hai geshshata. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tanan diite, taka intenan dana, hanggey woyne ano bolla doontta aggiko berkka ayfe ayfana danddaonttaysa mala inteka tanan doontta dishshe ayfee ayfanas danddaekista. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tane woyne miththa ano, inte qass hanggista, daroo ayfee ayfizadey tanan dizadene taka izan dizade, gasooyka ta bayndda inte aykoka ooththanas danddaekista. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tanan baynddadeey qanxxetidi woora yegetida hangge mala kare yegetidi hen melana, heyta mala hanggista issi bolla shiqqid taman yegistanane exxana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Inte tanan diiko ta qaalayka intenan diiko inte koydaysa oychchiko demmana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Daroo ayfee inte ayfishin ta aaway bonchetes, hessa malan inte tana kaallizayta gididaysi hessan erristana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Aaway tana dosiidaysatho taka intena dosadis, hessa gish inte ta siqqoon diite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tani ta aawa azazo polada iza siqqoon deyda mala inteka ta azazoo poliko ta siqqoon deyana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Haysa ta intes yootzay ta uhaaththaaysii intenan gidana malane inte uhaaththaaysiika kumethth gidanasiko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta intes immiza azazoy ta intena siqqida mala inteka inte garssan isay isara siqqistanasiko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Asi ba lagees ba shemhaaththao aththii immope adhiiza siqqooy deena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta Intena ta azazii wursi inte poliko inte ta laggeta. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ashshikaray goday ooththizaysa erroontta gish simma hayssafe guyee ta intena ashshikarata giikee, gido attin tani ta aawape siydaysa wursa intes qonccisiida gish ta intena ta laggeta gadiis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ta intena doradiis attin inte tana doribeykista, inte bidi daroo ayfee ayfana mala inte ayfeey eeqi dana mala ta intena wothadis, hessa gish inte ta sunththan woosidaysa wursi aaway intes immana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>hessa gish inte intee garssan isay isara siqqistana mala ta intena azazays.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay bena kaallizayta allamey ixxanaysa yootdees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kaalethidika Yesussay hizzgdes. “intena derey ixxiko intefee kase tana ixxidaysa errite. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inte ammanoontta dere asa gidikoo dere asay ba bagga gididade doses, gido attin inte dere bagga gidontta gish ta intena derepe shakkada dorida gish derey intena ixxees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ashshikaray godape adhena gada ta kase intes yootoysa yushsh qoopite, istti tana godizayti intenaka goddana, istt ta qaala naggizako inte qaala naggana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Istti tana kittidade errontta gish ta gaason inte bolla hessa wursi ooththana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ta yada isttas yootonttako isttas nagara gidenashin, hai qass istta nagaras haano giza gasooy bawa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tana ixxizadey ta aawaka ixxes. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hara urray oosontta ooso ta istta garssan oosonttako isttas nagara gideenashin hai istt hessa wursi beeydape guyee tanaka ta aawaka ixxida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessika handday kase &lt;tana gasooy bayndda dishin ixxida&gt; geetetdi istta wogan xaafetda qaalay polistanasiko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Gido attin aawape kezidi yanays taka ta aawa achchafe intes yedanays tumma ayanay minththethzays yidi izi ta gish markkatana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Inte koyropeka tanara diza gish tas inteka markkatanddista.”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qasseka yesussay hizzgdes “hekoo hayssa wursa ta intes inte ammanoy yarkketoope gada yootadiis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Isttii intena ba keethape goodana, haray attoshshin intena wodhizadeey wuri xoossas ooththzade milatza wodey yana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Istt hessaththo ooththizaay tanaka ta aawaka errontta gishshasa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta hayssa intes hessa gakiza wode inte ta intes gidaysa qoopanasiko.”</para>
  <para style="s">xiilo ayana ooththo</para>
  <para style="p">kaalleththidika yesussa hizzgdes “hayssa wursa ta intes yootontta aggiday ta intenara isife diza gishshasa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hai qasse tana kittdaysako bana gays gido attin intefe oonnika &lt;awaa ne bane? gidi oychchanay bawa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin hayssa wursa ta intes yootda gish inte wozinay muzetes. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta qasse tummu intes gays ta busii intes goo7e gidana, gasooyka ta bontta aggiko minththethiza ayanay intekoo yeena, ta bidappe guye iza intekoo yedana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Izi yidi asa nagara gishine xiilotetha gish qasseka pirda gish errisana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asa nagara gish izi errisanay asay tana ammanoontta gishshasa <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xiiloteththa gish izi asa errisanay tani ta aawako buusa gishshine qasse namm7enththo inte tana beeyontta gishshasa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pirda gish izi errisanay hayssa dereza aysiza bolla pirdetda gishshasa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta intes buuro yootana daroo yoy des gido attin hai intena dexxan. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tumu ayanay yidi intena tumay dizaso kaalleththana, gasooyka izi siiydaysa yotana attin bepee gidontta gish izi sinththafe hanana yoota intes yootana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tas dizaysape ekkidi izi intes yootza gish tana bonchana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Aawas gididay wurikka taysa &lt;tas gididaysape ekkidi izi intes yootana&gt; ta gidday hessasa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Inte muzetethi uhaaththaayssan lammistana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesussay gujjidi hizzgdes “guththa wodepe guye inte tana beeyekista, qasseka guththa wodepe guye inte tana beeyana.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iza kaallizaytape baggati ba garssan “haysii nus guththa wodeepe guye inte tana beeyekista qasseka guththa wodeepe guye inte tana beeyana, qasse ta aawako bana&gt; gusii ayy guse? gida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Histtin haysi &lt;guththa wodepe guye&gt; gizaysi izi aze? izi yootzays nus erretena” gidi ba garssan zar zar oychchetida. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Istti iza oychchanaysa Yesussay erridi isttas hizzgdess “inte inte garssan isay isara oychchetzay ta intes “guththa wodepe guye inte nana byyekista qadeeka gutha woodepe guye inte tana beyanaa&gt; gida gshshasee? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta intes tuma gays inte yekanashshb derey gidiko ufaana inte mmchistanashn inte mmchchy ufayydan ufaaysan lamistana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Maccashii yeloo woodey gakiishn mixxasii hrigayysu shn naa yella yegidapee guyee bista boola nay yelletda gish uhaaththaasafe dendayssan kase ba wayedaysa zara qoopuku. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hesatho inteeka hii mchchetista (yekista) qase ta intena beyana inte wozinaykka uhaaththaaeistana inte uhaaththaaysa zarii ekanadeey deena. <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Inte he woode tape aykooka wosedeista ta intes tumu gayys ta sunththa ta awa wosiiko intes wursikka iimana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hano gakanas inte ta sunththa aykooka wosi eerekista wosiite inte eekana inte uhaaththaaysaykka kumeeththa gidana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hii gakanas ta intes lemussora yootadis shn hyssafe huye ta lemusoora yotonta wodde yana gidoo atiin awa gish intes wurssa qoonccsa yootana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode inte ta nththan wosana taka &lt;awa inte gish wosana&gt; gikke. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Gasooyka away ba bagara intena dosiiza gishshasa away intena dosiizay inte tana dosiiza gishshasane ta Xoossa achchafe ydaysa intee amaniida gishshasa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tani awa achchfe kezzada hausa ha 7llamee yadissne qaseeka h 7llameza agada awako ta sima bana.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iza kaliizay hzgida “heko ne hii lemuson gidoonta nus qonccer yotadasaa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ne ubbaa eeriza malane oniika nena oycchcchanas koshontayssa hii nu eridassa hessa gishsha ne Xoossa achchafe kezidayysa nu amanoos.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesussayistas hzgides “intee hii amaniidista” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Gdoo atiin inte intee bagara laleetda tana xala agana wodeyy gakiides he satiyka hii gakkadus gidoo atiin away tanara gidida gish ta tarka gidiike. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ta hyysa intes yotizzay inte tanan deyyn intees sarotithii dana malla gada yotaays inte h 7llameen dishshn intes wayeyy dees gidoo atiin aykooy ba ta 7llamee xoondees.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussa wossa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa gidape guye pudee salo dhoqqu gi xeelid hizzgi wossides “aaboo hekoo hai saatey gakkides, ne nay nena bonchana mala neni ne naza boncha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ne bonchanayka ne izas immidaytas izi medhina deyoo immana mala ne izas asa wuriso bolla godateth immida gishshasa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Medhdhina deyooyka ne xalala tumu xoossu ne kiittda Yesuss Kiristtoosa erro guusa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ne tas immida ooso tani wursada ha biita bolla nena bonchadis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ta aawa! allamey medhdhistanape kase tas nenara diza bonchon haika tana ne achchan bonchariki <verse number="6" style="v"/>Haysa dere asape ne tas deeran immida asatas ne oonnakone ta isttas nena qonccsadis, istt kaseka neyta shin ne tas immadasa, isttika ne qaala nagida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ne tas immidaysi wurikka nepe gididaysa hai istti errida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ne tas immida qaalataka isttas immadis, isttika ekkida, ta ne achchafe yidaysa tumape errida, ne tana kittdaysaka istt ammanida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ta isttas wossays heytii ne tas immidayt istt neyta gidida gish ta isttas wossays, gidoshin hinkoo dere asas wossike. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tas gididay wurikka neysa neysika wurikka taysa, taka isttan bonchetana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hayssafe guye Tani hayssa biita bolla diike, istt gidiko ha biita bolla deetes, hai ta nekoo bays, ta geshshazo! hayta ne tas immidayta istti nu mala ba garssan issino gidana mala ne tas immida ne sunththan istta naga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta isttara isipe dashshe ne tas immida ne sunththan ta istta naggadis, ta naggadis, hessa gish kase xaafetda geshsha maxafa qaalay polistana mala izi kaseka dhayos diza nazape attin isttafe oonnika dhaybeyna. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta qasse hai neko bays, ta ha biita bolla dashshe hayssa yootizay ta uhaaththaaysi isttan polistana mala gada yootays. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tani ne qaala isttas immadis, tani ha biita asa ginddoonttaysa mala isttika ha biita asi gidetena, hessa gish ha biita asay istta ixxides. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ne istta iittape nagana mala ta nena wossays attin ne istta ha biitafe denththa efana mala nena wossike. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tani biita asi gidonttaysa mala isttika ha biita asii gidetena. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ne istta ne tuman nes shaaka, ne qaalayka tumu qaala. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ne tana ha biita kittoysaththo taka istta biita bolla kittadis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Istt tumape nes duma ass gidida mala tanika tana istta gish dummasays. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Istta qaala marikatetha tana ammananayta gishshara ta nena wossays attin ta nena istta gish xalala wossike. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ta wossizay istti wurikka issino gidana malasiko, ta aawawu qasseka ne tanan diza mala nunan gidana malane ne tana kittidaysa ha derey ne ammanana mala wossays. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nunii nu garssan issno gidida mala isttika ba garssan issino gidana mala ne tas ida boncho taka isttas immadis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ta wossizay sttan, neka tanan gidida mala isttika kumethth issino gidana malako, qasseka neni tana kittda mlane tana ne siqqida mala isttaka ne siqqidaysa dere asay erranasiko. <verse number="24" style="v"/>“ta aawawu! ne tana haysi biitayne saloy medhdhistanape kase dossida gish ne tas immidaa ta bonchoza istti beeyana mala hayta ne tas immidaytka ta dizasoon anara dana mala dossays. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Xiillo gidida ta aawawu! nena derey erribeyna, ta gidiko nena errays, haytka ne ana kittdaysa errida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ne tana siqqida siqqooy isttan gidana malane taka isttan gidana mala isttine nena errana mala ooththadis, qasseka istti errana malaka oohthana.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay ba moorkkista kushshen aadhi immetidesine oykketides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa wursi yootidape guye Yesussay bena kaallizaytara Qeedirone geetetza shooba pinidi akakiltte gidoo gelidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesussayne iza kaallizayti kasseka he gadeyin daroo wode isife shiqiza gish Yesussa aththi immida Y uday he gadeyo kasseka erress. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yuday wotadarata, qeessista halaqatane Farssawistape kitteti yida ashshikarata wursi kaalleththi ekkidi he istti shiqizaso yidees. Izara yida asay paanoose, xoomipenee mashsha toora oykkidi yidees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesussay ba bolla gakkanaysa wursi erridi yida asako bidi “Oonna koyeti? gides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Istti qasse “Nazireete yesussa koyoos” gida, Izika isttas “Tani izakoo” gidees. Isttas aththi immida yuday isttara isife eqqides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesussay “Ta izako” gida mala asati guye ganddigaridi biita bolla kunddida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesussay ha7ika “Oonna koyeeti?” gidi oychchin istti zaaridi “Nazireete Yesussa koyoos” gida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Izika zaaridi “Tani izako gadiiskkoo, histtkoo inte koyizay tana gidikoo hayti beto bochchofite” gides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hesi haniday “Ta aawawu ne tas immidaytape issadeka ta dhaysabeykee” gida qaalay poleistana malako. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Simmoona geetetza phixxirossay giththa mashsha oykkda gish mashsha shohope shodidi issi qeessista halaqa ashshikara dizaysa haythe mashshara padhi yegides. He ashshikaraza sunththi “malkosa” geetetes. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesussay qasse phixxirossa “Ne mashsha gede shohon zara gelththa. Nees ta aaway tas immida metoo ushsha ta uyoontta milatizee?” gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Qessista Halaqa Haana Geetetizaysa Sinthth Shiqides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessafe guye wootadarati, istta azazizaysinne Ayhudata ashshikarati Yesussa oykkidi qachchida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Koyro he laythas qessistas halaqa gidida qayafaa bollo Haannakko ehaaththaida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qayafaay “Deere gish issadey hayqqiko lo7okko” gidi Ayhudata dulata kase zooridade.</para>
  <para style="s">Phixxirossay Yesussa kadides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Simmona geetettiza phixxirossayne Yesussa kaallizaytape issadey yesussa kaallida. He uray qessista halaqa achchan kehi erretidade. Hessa gish Yesussara isife qessista halaqaza gibbe gelides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Phixxirossay gidikko penggefe kare baggara eqqdees. Qessista halaqa achchan kehi erretdi Yesussa kaallizaysi yidine penggen diza garadeya phixxirossa gibbe giddo gelththana mala yootdi Pixirosa ekki gelides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pengge naggiza garadeya Phixxirossa “Neka hessa addeza kaalliza asatape issa gidikki?” gadus. Izi qasse “Tani iza kaallizade gidike” gides. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wodey meegiza wode gidida gish ooththanchatnne ashshikarati tama eththidi eqoon ho7etes. Pixxirossaykka isttara eqidii ho7es.</para>
  <para style="s">Qessista halaqape Yesussas shiqida oychcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>He wode qeessista halaqay Yesussa iza kaallizayta gishane izi tammarisida tmmirtte gish oychchides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesussayka izas “Ta asa wursos qoonccen yootadas. Ayhudati shiqiza istta wossa keeththan gidinkka Xoossa keeththan tammarisadis; ta qootan haasa7idazii aykoyka deena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Histtin ne tana oychchizay aazee? ta yootshshin siydayta oychcha; ta yootdiysa istti erretes” gides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesussay hessa gida mala hen eqida ashshikaratape issay “Qeessista halaqas hayssaththo wosta zaaray” gishe Yesussa shagalan baqqa shayides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesussayka zaaridi “Ta iitta hasa7ida gidiko anne ta gooysa ne markkata; ta yootday likee gidiko tana aazas baqqaz?” gides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Haanay qachchetida mala Yesussa Qeessista halaqa Qayafaakoo yedidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Phixxrossay Yesussa Qasseka Kadides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>He wode Simmoona geetetza Phixxrossay eqqidii tama ho7ishin hankko asay iza haysoo, ne Yesussa kaallizaytape issa gidikii?” gida. Izika zaaridi “Ta iza kaallizade gidike” giidi kadides. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kase Pixxrossay iza hayththe qanxxiidayssa dabooy qeessista halaqa ashshikaratape issay “wona ta nena akaakilitesoon isttara dishin beeyabeykkina? gidees. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pixxrossay qassekka kadides, heraka kutooy wasides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Dere hariza Philaxoossa sinthth shiqdees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesussa Qayahaaththaa keeththafe dere aysiza kawooza gibbe malladoo wonttara ekki bidda. Ayhuda asas pazziga ba77ele dorssa ashsho mizza wode gidida gish bena tunisontta mala giidi malladora dere aysizaysa gibbe gidoo gelibeytena.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">verse 28 needs foot note about passover</char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gish Philaxoossay gede isttako kezidi “Hayssa addeza inte aazas mootetii?” gidii oychchidees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Istti qasse “Haysi addeezi iita oosonttade gididako nu iza nes aththi immokoko shin” gida <verse number="31" style="v"/>Philaxossayka “Inte iza ekki bidi inte woga mala pirditee” gidees. Ayhudata aysizayti qasse zaaridi “Nu ass wodhana mala nuus fiqadey immetibeyna” gides <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessika haniday Yesussay kase isttas izi waani hayqanakoone yoottida qaalay polistana gishshasko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Philaxoosay qasseka guye gibbe gido gelidi Yesussa xeeygisidi “Ne Ayhudata kawoo?” gidii oychchidees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesussaykka zaaridi “Ne hessa gizay nepeyee woykoo hara asatii ta gish nes yoottdoo?” gides. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Philaxoossayka “Ta Ayhuda asee? Nena tas aththi immidayti ne baggatanne qeessista halaqattako; ne ayy ooththadii?” gides. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesussaykka “Ta kawootethi hayssa ha biita bolla gideena, ta kawootethi hayssa ha biita bolla gididakoo Ayhudata dannata kushshen ta kunddoontta mala ta ashshikarati ta gish olistanakoshin. Ta kawootethi gidikoo ha biita bolla gideena” gides. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Philaxoossayka “Histtin ne kawoo?” gides, Yesussay qasse “Tani ne gidaysa mala ee kawoo, ta yeleetidayne ha biitta yiday tuma gish markkatanasko. Tumape gididay wuri ta qaala siyees” gides. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Philaxoossayka “Tumay azee?” gides. Hessafe guye Phiilaxossay namm7enththo Ayhudatako kezzidi “Ta iza bolla ayko bala beyabeyke. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Gido attin kasseka ta intes paziga ba77ele gaalas issi qachcho ass birshiza mala hayssa Ayhudata kawoo intes birshana mala koyeetii?” gides. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Istti gidiko “nus Barbbanne birsha attin hayssa gideena!” giidi wassida. Barbbanney ba hu7es pangga.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wotadarati Yesussa bolla qidhdhi ka7ida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Philaxoossay Yesussa eefidi gaarafisiidees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wotadaratikka aguunththa zawuude xaxiidi Yesussa hu7en woththida, zo77o kabakka mayzzida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Izako shiqqi shiqqdi “Ayhuda kawoo saaro saaro!” gi gidi iza shagalan baqqida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Philaxxossay qasseka kare kesiidi “Heko ta iza bolla aykoo morooka demoonttaysa inte errana mala ta iza intes haa kare kessana” gides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gish Yesussay aguunththa zawuude hu7en woththi ekkidine zo77o kaba maydi kare keziides. Philaxxossayka isttas “Hekoo addezi haysichchi!” gides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>eQessista halaqatine istta ashshikarat Yesussa beeydi “Ne iza kaqqa! kaqqa!” gishe wasiida, Philaxxossay qasse “Ta ta baggara iza bolla issi moroka demmabeyke, koykoo inte ehaaththaidii kaqqite” gides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ayhuda asati qasse “Nuus wogay dees haysi addezi beena xoossa na giza gish nu woga mala izas hayqqoy besees” gida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Philaxxossay hessa istti gizaysa siydi daroo babides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gede gibbe gelidi Yesussa “ne awape yadii?” gidi oychchidees. Yesussay qasse izas ayy malththeka immibeyna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gish Philaxxossay “ne tas yootiki? ta nena kaqqanas woykko birsha yedanas godatethi tas dizayssa errikii?” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesussayka izas zaaridi “sheeney ness Xoossafe immetoonttako nes ta bolla ay godatethika deenashin, gido attin tana nes aththi immidade bolla gita nagaray dees” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussa Bolla Hayqoo Pirday Pirdetides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Philaxxossay hessa Yesussa hassa7e siydapee guye iza birshi yedana koyides shin Ayudatas babida gish istti “ne hayssa addeza birshiko Rome kawoo qeessare bagga gidaka, gasooyka bena berkka kawooththizadey wuri Qeessares moorkke” gishe wurikka wasiida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Philaxxossay hessa siyda mala Yesussa gede kare kesisidi “Loochcha shuchchu” geetettiza soon pirda wombbaran uttides. He pirda sooy ayhudata qaalara “Gabata” getetes. <verse number="14" style="v"/>He wode gadeey asii paziga ba77eles gigettiza gaalasa. Wodeyka gaalasafe usuupun saate mala gidides. He wode Philaxxosay Ayhudata “Hekoo inte kawoy hayssichii!” gides. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gido attin istti qass “Gede digga, gede digga, kaqqa” gishe wasiida. Philaxxossayka “inte kawoo kaqqoo?” gides. Qeessista halaqati zaaridi “nus Qessarepe hara kawooy deena” gida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessafe simmidi Philaxxosay Yesussa kaqqistana mala isttas aththi immides. Isttka Yesussa oykki ekkii ehaaththaida.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay kaqqetides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesussay ba kaqqistana masqqaleza tookidii “Asa hu7ee guuge” geetettizaso kezides. He sooy Ayhudata qaalara “Golggoota” geetetes. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iza heen kaqqiida. Yesussa gidoo gelththidi hara namm7u asata izatho hadirssarane oshshachchara kaqqidda. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Philaxxossay “Nazzirete Yesussay Ayhudata kawoo” giza qaala xaafidi iza masqqale bolla izas hu7esora qaphides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesussay kaqqetidasooy katamas mata gidida gish daroo Ayhuda asay Philaxxossay xaafidaysa nababidees. Xaafeetidaysika Ayhudata qaalara, Latiine geetettiza qaalarane Girikee qaalarako. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ayhudata qeessata Halaqati Philaxxossa “ne iza Ayhudata kawoo” gada xaafoopa, Gido attin “&lt;haysi addezii bena ta Ayhudata kawoo gidees&gt; gada xaafa” gida. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Philaxxossay qass “Ta xaafidaysa xaafadis” gides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wootadarati Yesussa kaqqidape guye iza mayooza ekkidi wotadarata issa issa gakana mala oydu kessi shakereththida. Garsara mayiza mayozaka hessaththo shakereththida. Ggido attin garsara mayza mayoz siketoontta pudepe duge gakkanaas coo yeda dees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gish wotadarati ba garssan “Gishan oonna gakkanakoone errana mala iza bolla exxa yeggana attin dakooko” gida. Hessika hanidday kase “Ta mayoo istti gishshetii ekkida, ta bollara mayza mayoza bolla exxa yegiida” getetida geesha maxaafa qaalay poleistana malasa. Wotararatikka heesa oothida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesussa masqqalle achchan iza aayiyane aayeeyi michchiya Qeliyyopha machcha Maramane Megidele geetettizasope yida Marama heen eqqida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesussay ba ayiyone izi siqqza iza kaallizaysi ba achchan eqqidayta beeydi, ba aayiyo “Aayee ne naza hessa beeya” gides. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessafe kaalleththidi bena kaallizaysa “Ne ayo hinoo beeya” gides. Hinoo he saateype simmin he iza kaallizaysi Aayiyo besso ehaaththaidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Hayqqidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesussay ha7i wurikka poleettidaysa erridi geesha maxaafan xaafetdaysi poleistana mala “tana samees” gides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Heen gadan caala phanqqida ushshii kumii uttida issi xaarro malay dees. Hessa gish heen gadan dizayti he caala ushsha zanzza milatza sppoonjje gizaysara hisophphe giza miththa xeeran qaphidi iza dunako shishshida. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesussay he caalla ushsha xunxxi xeellidi “poleetides!” gides. Be hu7e duge ziqisidi shempo kezides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Ayhudata danati kaqqetida asata meeqqethth wodirape menththidi istt iza masqqsale bollafe woththana mala Philaxxossa wossiida. Istti hessa ooththiday Ayhudati sambbatas gigetiza gaalas gidida gishshine he sambbatayka daroo giita ba77ale gidida gish sambbata gaalas ahay masqqale bolla gami77ontta malla koyida gishasa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessa gish wotadarati bidii Yesussara kaqqetiida asata meqqethth wodiirape wodiirape menththida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Istti Yesussako biin izi kasetidinee hayqqdaysa beeydi iza wodiira meqqethth menththibeyteena. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Gido attin wotadarata garssafe issadey toorara iza miileen cadiin heeraka suththine haththi gukkidees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessa beeydadeyi inte izan ammanana mala markkattdes. Iza markkayka tuma. Izi yootzayka tumu gididaysa izi errees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessika haniday “Iza meqqeththafe isinaka meeqquku” geetetida geesha maxaafa qaalay polistanassa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Qasseka geesha maxafa harason “Istti ba caadide beeyana” gees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay mogetidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ayhudata dannata babidi qotan Yesussa kaalliza Armmatyasa getetizasoppe yida Yossefoy Yesussa aha ekkanas Philaxoossa wossin Philaxoossayka izas eeroo gides. Hessa gish Yossefoy bidi Yesussa aha ekkidees. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kase Yesussakko qamara yida Niqoodimossayka kiilo bagga gidiza karbbeenne ireete geetettiza mishshara walakeetida shiito ekki yidees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>He namm7u asati Yesussa aha ekkidi Ayhudatii aha xaxiza mala shiito cacafidii le77e mayora xaxida. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesussay kaqqetidason issi akakilitesoy dees. He akakilitezason oonnika moggetonttay oraththa dufooy dess. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ayhudata sambbatas gigeteza gaalas gidida gishshinne dufooykka matan diza gish Yesussa aha heen mogiida.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay hayqqoope denddides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wooga gaalas wontta malado buroo sosey zoishshin Magidale marama Yesussa dufooko badusu. Iza he gakkishin kase Yesussa dufoo izara goordida shuuchay dufooza duunape denddidi gendderidaysa beeyadusu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessa gish iza Yesussa kaallizaytape Simmoona geetetiiza Pixirosakko Yesuyssay dosiza hankko iza kaallizaysako woxxa bada “Goda dufooppe keesi ekkidi awan woththidakone nu erroko” gadusu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Heraka Pixxrossayne Yesussa kaalliza hinkko issay kezzidi gede duhaaththaoy dizasoo bida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Namm7eyka ishaaththaee woxxida, gido attin Yesussa kaalliza hinkkoysi Pixxrossape pilatii woxxidi kaseti dufooy dizasoo gakkides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Dufooza hookii xeelidi ahay xaxxetida mayoo xala dizayssa beeydes. Gido attin gede dufoo giido gellibeeyna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Simmoona geetettiza Pixxrossayka iza kaalli gakkidi dufooza giido gellidees, ahay izan xaxxetida cariqqay hen dizayssa beeydes. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesussa hu77ey xaxxetida carqqay hankko xaththa carqqatara gidoontta duuma harasson xaxxeti dizayssa beeydees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Koyroti gakkida Yesussa kaallizzaysika dufooza giido geli beeydi ammanides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gasooyka “Izi hayqqope denddana beeses” giza maaxxafe qaala istti buroo hasa7ibeeytena. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessafe guye namm7etika simmidi besso besso bida.</para>
  <para style="s">Magidale marama Yesussa beeyadusu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Magidale marama yeekashshe Yesussa dufoope kareera eqqada hokka dufooza giido xeelladus. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesussa Ahay dizasson boththa mayoo mayda namm7u kitanchatape issay hu7eson issay toson uttidayta beeyadus. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isttika Maramo “Hane maccashshayee azaas yeekazii?” gida, izaka “Istti ta Goda ehaaththaidii awan woththidakoone ta errike gadus. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iza hiino gada guye yuyshshin Yesussay eqqidayssa demaduus shin izi Yesussa gididayssa errabeykku. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesussay izo “Hanne maccashshayee! azass yeekazzi? Qasse oonna kooyazzi?” &gt; gides, izika iziis akakkiltte nagizzadee millatiin “Godo! ne ekkida gidikoo ne woththidasso tass yootarkki, ta iza tass ekkana” gaduus. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesussay izo “Marame!” gides, izakka gede izakko simmada ayhudata qaalara “Rebuune!” gaduus, hessa birshechchi “asttamaree” guusa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesussay qass “Ta buroo pude ta aawako kezzabeykke tana oykoofa, gido attin ne ha7i ta ishatakko bada “Ta ta aawakone inte aawako, ta xoossakone inte xoossako kezana gides gada isttas yoota” gides. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa gish Magidale Marama Yesussa kaallizaytako bada iza Yesussa beeydaysane izi izis yootidaysa isttas yootadusu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay bena kaallizaytas betidees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>He gaalas wooga Omarss Yesussa kaallizayti Ayhudata dannatas babidii kare ba bolla goordidi keeththa giidon shiqoon dishshin karey dooyetoontta Yesussay iza kaallizayti shiqii diza keeththa gellidees. Istta gidoon eqqidii “Saaroy intes giidoo!” gides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gi smmidi ba kushshistane ba miiye istta beesides. Iza kaallizaytika goda beeydii keezi uhaaththaa7etida. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessafe guye qasseka Yesussay istta “intes saaroy gido! ta aaway tana kittda mala taka intena kittays” gides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gi simmidi istta bolla uuhaaththau gidi “inte Xiiloo Ayana ekkite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Inte asa nagara atto gikko isttas atto geteettana, inte asa nagara attoo gontta ixxiko qass isttas attoo geteteena” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussane Toomassa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesussay bena kaallizaytako yida wode tammane namm7istape issay Didimossa geteetiiza Toomassy isttara denna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gish hankko Yseussa kaallizayti Toomassa “Nu Goda beeydooskko” gida. Toomassay qass “Miismmaren cadeetida iza kushshista ta ta ayfeera beeyoontta dahshene qasseka ta birdhdhe miismmarey gelidason gelitha xeelontta dashshene ta kushshe iza miiye maddunththan gelththa xeelontta dashshe ammanikke” gides. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessafe kaallin osppun gaalasafe guye iza kaallizayti qasseka keeththa gidoon dishshin Tommssayka isttara isife dishshin kareyka goordana dishshin Yesussay yiidi istta gidoon eqqidi “s saarotethth intes gido” gides. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Toomassa “Ne biradhdhe ha ehada ta kushshista beeya. Ne kushshe ha ehada ta miiyeen gelitha ammana attin ammanonttade gidoopa” gides. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Toomassay “Ta Godoo! Ta Xoosso!” gides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesussayka Toomassa “Neni tana beeyda gish ammanddassa, tana beeyoontta ammanizayti gidiko istti galateetidayta” gides. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hayssa maaxfan xaafetontta daroo malatata bena kaallizayta sinththan Yesussay oththides. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido attin Yesussay ha yana kittetida Xoossa nay iza gididaysa inte errana malane ammanidi inte iza sunththan deyoo demana mala haysi xaafettdes.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Bena kaallizaytappe lappunatas beetides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesussay Xibiradoose abba achchan bena kaallizaytas qasseka beetdes. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simmoona geetettiza Pixxiroossay Didimoossa geetettiza Toomassay Gallila Qanna ass gidida Natinaelley Zabidossa naytika Yesussa kaallizaytape hara namm7ati wuri isife dishshin <verse number="3" style="v"/>Simmoona geetettiza Pixxiroossay isttas “Ta moole oykkana bays” gides, isttika izas “Nukka nenara bana” gida, izara kezzi bidi wogoolon gellida shin he gaalas omarssi issi mooleka oykkibeytena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gadey wonttishshin Yesussay abba achchan eqqides, iza kaallizaytii qass izi Yesussa gididayssa erribeyteena. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesussay istta “Naytoo mooley dizze?” gides, isttika “aykooka bawa” gida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Izika “Giteza wogoolozape oshshacha baggara abban yeegite, inte demmana” gida gish giiteza abba giido yeegidane daroo mooley oykeetda gish giiteza molara gochchana danddaebeyitena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa wode Yesussay iza kaallizaytape Yesusa iza siqiza issay Pixxirossa “Hesi Godakko!” gides. Simmoona geetetza Phixxiroossay “hesi Godakko” giza qaala siyda mala kasse ooso diigofo gidi mayoo qaari woththidi kaloo diza gish herakka mayoo ekki mayidi abba giido guuppi gelidees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesussa kaalliza hankkoyti qass biitafe xeetu mitire mala hakii diza gish mooley kumi dizza giiteza gochchi ekkidi wogoolora gakkida. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Istti wogoolozape wodhdhishin moley iza bolla diza bonqqo tamane ukethth beeyda. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesussay istta “Ha7i inte oykkida molezape ha ekki yiite” gides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gish simmoona geetettiza Phixxiroossay wogooloza giido gellidi xeistane ichchachchu taammane hedzdzu woogga giita mooleti kumiida giiteza abbafe gede gade bolla gochchides. Hessa mala daroo molera diinika giitezi daketibeeyna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessafe guye Yesussay istta “Ha yidi miite” gides. Izi Goda Yesussa gididaysa wursi errida gish iza kaallizaytape issadeykka “Ne oonne” gi oychchanas xallidadey bawa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesussay yidi ukeththane moleza ekkidi isttas immides. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesussay hayqqope denddin iza kaallizayti iza beeyshshin haysi hedzdzanththo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesussay Phixxiroossa oychchida oychcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Istti mii gigishshin Yesussay simmoona Phixxiroossa “Yoona na Simmoona! hayiti tana dosizayssafe aththa tana dossayii?” gides. Izikka “Ee ta Godo! ta nena dosizayssa nekka errasa” gides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesussay iza “Ta laqqata hemma” gides, namm7enththoka “Yoona na Simmoona! ne tana dossay?” gides, izika zaarid “Ee Godo! Ta nena dosizaysa neka errasa” gides, Yesussay qass “laqqata naga” gides, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hedzdzanththo “Yoona na Simmoona Ne tana doossay?” gides. Izi hedzdzanththo “Ne tana dossay” gida gish Pixroossay michchetidine “Godo ne ubbaa errasa ta nena dosizayssakka errasa” gides, Yesussayka qasseka “Ta doorisata hemma” gides. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta nes tumu gays ne naatethan dashshe ne giththe nerkka gixxada ne koydasso baasashin ne ciimmiza wode gidiko ne ne kushshista pidiisin hara urray nena gixxisanane ne dosoonttaso nena ehaaththaana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Izi Iza hessaththo giday Pixxroossay ay mala hayqqon xoossu bonchanakone izas erisanaskko. hessafe guye Phixxiroossa “Ne tana kaalla” gides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Phixxiroossay yushshi xeelidi Yesussay dosizaysi iza kaallishin beeydes. He urray kase istt ka7o mishshin Yesussa hayththako shiqidi “Godo nena aththi immanadey izi oonne?” gii oychchides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pixxroossay iza beeydi “Godo hayssadeych wanandde?” gidi Yesussa oychchides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesussaykka izas “Ta ha yana gakkanaashin ta iza paxxa woththiko nena azi gaththidee? ne tana kaalla” gides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gaason ishshata garssan “izi hayqqo hayqqena” giza worey lalletides. Gido attin Yesussay “ta yana gakkanaas paxxa dana mala ta koyko nena azze gaththiday?” gidees attin “hayqqakka” giibeyna. <verse number="24" style="v"/>He yoota gish markkatidayne xaafiday ha Yesussa kaallizayssa. Iza markkatethika tumu gididayssa nuni erroos. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesussay oththida hara darooti deetes. Tas milatiza mala izi ooththida miishshata wursi issi bolla xaafizako xaafeetiza maxaafata haysii biitay tokkana dandda7ena.</para>
</usx>
